(1773826, 242224, 37961, '<td valign="top">Mandy?  Brilliant Entry! 10.</td>', 'Mandy?  Brilliant Entry! 10.', '2005-10-10 10:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773829, 241747, 37961, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. I love the way you chose to shoot this shot. The smoke in the center of the photo and the man with the bucket and lady with that hat is great. 10.</td>', 'Excellent photo. I love the way you chose to shoot this shot. The smoke in the center of the photo and the man with the bucket and lady with that hat is great. 10.', '2005-10-10 10:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773840, 241892, 29474, '<td valign="top">This is such a good photograph. But not for this challenge. I don''t see celebration in this.</td>', 'This is such a good photograph. But not for this challenge. I don''t see celebration in this.', '2005-10-10 10:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773846, 241586, 29474, '<td valign="top">Good photograph. But not for this challenge. Maybe if there was a big Happy Birthday banner stretched across the bridge.</td>', 'Good photograph. But not for this challenge. Maybe if there was a big Happy Birthday banner stretched across the bridge.', '2005-10-10 10:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773865, 241842, 29474, '<td valign="top">I like the colours an composition. But it doesn''t say celebration to me.</td>', 'I like the colours an composition. But it doesn''t say celebration to me.', '2005-10-10 10:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773887, 241731, 31403, '<td valign="top">them''s glowing jets!  A little dodging to the sky would have been nicer here.  I''ll bet it was a fun show to shoot thought!</td>', 'them''s glowing jets!  A little dodging to the sky would have been nicer here.  I''ll bet it was a fun show to shoot thought!', '2005-10-10 11:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773899, 242141, 40819, '<td valign="top">roo much color</td>', 'roo much color', '2005-10-10 11:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773902, 242148, 43463, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot. However the darkness and/or haze of the upper atmosphere (upper portion of the photo) detracts from the appeal of this photo. The ballons lower to the surface of the ground are lit much more and as such are more colorful that the ones higher above. Those would have been the better choice to focus the viewer''s attention on in this composition. That, and the mist gently rolling off the trees. If it were possible just to frame your compositin with the bottom half of the image you would have a wonderfully captivating image that would capture and HOLD the viewer''s attention. The image would only show it''s strengths and not any weaknesses such that it would enchant the viewer. Don''t get me wrong, this is a good photograph, it is just the framing of the subjects could be better. As a matter of fact, if you just sit back and look at the lower portion of the photo on screen it really is captivating and mesmerizing. Just that portion of this image would make a fabulious capture to hang on someone''s wall.</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot. However the darkness and/or haze of the upper atmosphere (upper portion of the photo) detracts from the appeal of this photo. The ballons lower to the surface of the ground are lit much more and as such are more colorful that the ones higher above. Those would have been the better choice to focus the viewer''s attention on in this composition. That, and the mist gently rolling off the trees. If it were possible just to frame your compositin with the bottom half of the image you would have a wonderfully captivating image that would capture and HOLD the viewer''s attention. The image would only show it''s strengths and not any weaknesses such that it would enchant the viewer. Don''t get me wrong, this is a good photograph, it is just the framing of the subjects could be better. As a matter of fact, if you just sit back and look at the lower portion of the photo on screen it really is captivating and mesmerizing. Just that portion of this image would make a fabulious capture to hang on someone''s wall.', '2005-10-10 11:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773903, 241886, 29474, '<td valign="top">Wow. At last. A real celebratory picture.</td>', 'Wow. At last. A real celebratory picture.', '2005-10-10 11:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773908, 241890, 31005, '<td valign="top">very beautiful!</td>', 'very beautiful!', '2005-10-10 11:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773912, 242232, 43463, '<td valign="top">I like the warm tones seen here and especially how it baths  the model in a warm tones. I like how she is posed with her eyes looking up as she tips the glass of wine towards her lips in expectation. The viewer wonders just what is off screen that she maybe looking at. The only really big nit is that the wine in the glass appears to dark. It would have strengthened the overall appeal of the image if you could have brought out the rich deep tones of the red wine. Showing that deep, rich color of the red would help the viewer partake in the enjoyment of "drinking" in this image.</td>', 'I like the warm tones seen here and especially how it baths  the model in a warm tones. I like how she is posed with her eyes looking up as she tips the glass of wine towards her lips in expectation. The viewer wonders just what is off screen that she maybe looking at. The only really big nit is that the wine in the glass appears to dark. It would have strengthened the overall appeal of the image if you could have brought out the rich deep tones of the red wine. Showing that deep, rich color of the red would help the viewer partake in the enjoyment of "drinking" in this image.', '2005-10-10 11:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773915, 241826, 43463, '<td valign="top">It is a nice capture, but one that could be greatly strenthened by the happy couple in the background being more sharply in focus. The main thing in focus is the gentleman''s hand signing the document in the foreground. And while that is pivital to the scene, so are the smiles on the faces of all three people who are in this shot. Closing down the aperature to perhaps 8 or higher (ASA would need adjustment to that setting if you are doing it manually) would get you a sharper in focus background as well as the foreground. I love the smiling faces here in this shot and would like to have seen them much more clearly and vividly. I also think that you cropped the frame too tightly such that that we only get to see half of the beautiful smiling face of the bride.</td>', 'It is a nice capture, but one that could be greatly strenthened by the happy couple in the background being more sharply in focus. The main thing in focus is the gentleman''s hand signing the document in the foreground. And while that is pivital to the scene, so are the smiles on the faces of all three people who are in this shot. Closing down the aperature to perhaps 8 or higher (ASA would need adjustment to that setting if you are doing it manually) would get you a sharper in focus background as well as the foreground. I love the smiling faces here in this shot and would like to have seen them much more clearly and vividly. I also think that you cropped the frame too tightly such that that we only get to see half of the beautiful smiling face of the bride.', '2005-10-10 11:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773919, 242093, 43463, '<td valign="top">The lighting is really good and shows the subject off really well. The best part - the expression and action going on it this shot. One cannot help but to smile and the bugged eye surprise on the man''s face and the exploding cigar.</td>', 'The lighting is really good and shows the subject off really well. The best part - the expression and action going on it this shot. One cannot help but to smile and the bugged eye surprise on the man''s face and the exploding cigar.', '2005-10-10 11:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773920, 241750, 31403, '<td valign="top">what is the subject of this photo?  the background is so busy I can''t tell what is going on, and the people in the foreground are facing the other way.  1</td>', 'what is the subject of this photo?  the background is so busy I can''t tell what is going on, and the people in the foreground are facing the other way.  1', '2005-10-10 11:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773926, 240730, 31403, '<td valign="top">this is a marilyn manson album cover, not a celebration - ah to be young and enjoy rocking the boat - 4</td>', 'this is a marilyn manson album cover, not a celebration - ah to be young and enjoy rocking the boat - 4', '2005-10-10 11:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773931, 241800, 43463, '<td valign="top">A sweet and endearing capture. But the lack of tighter focus on the main subject and all the unattractive elements surrounding here weaken the composition. A tighter focus on the little girl tugging the pumpkin on the wagon along the path adorned with pumpkins would have been a much stronger composition. The truck, signs, speaker pole, and telephone wires in the background are unappealing and do nothing to enhance the composition - they detract from it. If the truck was moving I guess you could have waited for it to move out of the frame and zoomed in for a tigher shot such that we don''t see that much space to the right and left of her other than a few pumpkins "outlineing" the right and left sides of the newly composed shot.</td>', 'A sweet and endearing capture. But the lack of tighter focus on the main subject and all the unattractive elements surrounding here weaken the composition. A tighter focus on the little girl tugging the pumpkin on the wagon along the path adorned with pumpkins would have been a much stronger composition. The truck, signs, speaker pole, and telephone wires in the background are unappealing and do nothing to enhance the composition - they detract from it. If the truck was moving I guess you could have waited for it to move out of the frame and zoomed in for a tigher shot such that we don''t see that much space to the right and left of her other than a few pumpkins "outlineing" the right and left sides of the newly composed shot.', '2005-10-10 11:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773933, 241900, 40819, '<td valign="top">Enough with dressing up the dog.</td>', 'Enough with dressing up the dog.', '2005-10-10 11:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773934, 241939, 2667, '<td valign="top">outstanding. I could point out all the things I like but I would be here all morning. The focus effect is the most engaging element, but the nostalgic charm runs a close second. Good luck!</td>', 'outstanding. I could point out all the things I like but I would be here all morning. The focus effect is the most engaging element, but the nostalgic charm runs a close second. Good luck!', '2005-10-10 11:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773936, 241413, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is really a phenomenal shot.  Love it...  New life springs eternal...  Great job.  The focus &amp; DOF really bring it home.</td>', 'This is really a phenomenal shot.  Love it...  New life springs eternal...  Great job.  The focus & DOF really bring it home.', '2005-10-10 11:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773937, 241984, 34659, '<td valign="top">I think you mean 4 hours...  ;-)  Good shot.</td>', 'I think you mean 4 hours...  ;-)  Good shot.', '2005-10-10 11:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773939, 242198, 34659, '<td valign="top">ROFLMAO  Good one!  (Good shot too!)</td>', 'ROFLMAO  Good one!  (Good shot too!)', '2005-10-10 11:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773940, 242075, 43463, '<td valign="top">A good shot but it could be moved up into the superb category if you had framed the subject better.A tighter focus on just the boy holding this heavy pumpkin such that he fills most of the frame would have greatly improved this shot. Also we see that wonderful child''s smile but we don''t get to see the sparkle in his eyes because he is squinting. Making sure that your subject is not staring or looking at the direction of the sun would have cut down on the squint factor</td>', 'A good shot but it could be moved up into the superb category if you had framed the subject better.A tighter focus on just the boy holding this heavy pumpkin such that he fills most of the frame would have greatly improved this shot. Also we see that wonderful child''s smile but we don''t get to see the sparkle in his eyes because he is squinting. Making sure that your subject is not staring or looking at the direction of the sun would have cut down on the squint factor', '2005-10-10 11:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773946, 240755, 34659, '<td valign="top">WOW...  Here''s a shot where I think the centered subject works quite well because of the off-balanced weight of the waves crashing against the breakers.  Beautiful tones and power.  Terrific shot.</td>', 'WOW...  Here''s a shot where I think the centered subject works quite well because of the off-balanced weight of the waves crashing against the breakers.  Beautiful tones and power.  Terrific shot.', '2005-10-10 11:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773950, 241916, 40819, '<td valign="top">too dark 1</td>', 'too dark 1', '2005-10-10 11:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773951, 242096, 43463, '<td valign="top">Certainly a colorful and interesting photo. But we see that they are dancer''s yet the way you composed the shot does nothing to give the viewer the sense of movement - action- dancing. Pulling back just a little more and maybe just focusing on two of the dancers such that we see their feet and their arms moving to the beat of the music would have greatly improved the capture. We would "See" the dancing going on in the shot instead of relying on the title and costumes to tell us so.</td>', 'Certainly a colorful and interesting photo. But we see that they are dancer''s yet the way you composed the shot does nothing to give the viewer the sense of movement - action- dancing. Pulling back just a little more and maybe just focusing on two of the dancers such that we see their feet and their arms moving to the beat of the music would have greatly improved the capture. We would "See" the dancing going on in the shot instead of relying on the title and costumes to tell us so.', '2005-10-10 11:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773952, 242148, 34659, '<td valign="top">Love the backlighting on the trees and clouds - almost wish you could have brought out more color on the balloons though.  The clipped right balloon is a bit of a distraction, but I''m nitpicking here.  ;-)  Still a fantastic shot.  Really great capture!</td>', 'Love the backlighting on the trees and clouds - almost wish you could have brought out more color on the balloons though.  The clipped right balloon is a bit of a distraction, but I''m nitpicking here.  ;-)  Still a fantastic shot.  Really great capture!', '2005-10-10 11:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773955, 241667, 34659, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting &amp; processing here!  You''ve managed to turn something very ordinary into something quite extraordinary.  The color tones are marvelous and I can almost smell the leaves.  Great job.</td>', 'Love the lighting & processing here!  You''ve managed to turn something very ordinary into something quite extraordinary.  The color tones are marvelous and I can almost smell the leaves.  Great job.', '2005-10-10 11:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773956, 242098, 34659, '<td valign="top">VERY cool capture.</td>', 'VERY cool capture.', '2005-10-10 11:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773959, 241731, 40819, '<td valign="top">I am trying to figure out what you did to this picture, the Blue Angels have blue and gold planes. The gold should look more yellow then orange. Plus too much unsharp mask used it made a glow around the planes.</td>', 'I am trying to figure out what you did to this picture, the Blue Angels have blue and gold planes. The gold should look more yellow then orange. Plus too much unsharp mask used it made a glow around the planes.', '2005-10-10 12:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773960, 240755, 40819, '<td valign="top">too dark</td>', 'too dark', '2005-10-10 12:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773962, 241219, 40819, '<td valign="top">have not a clue.</td>', 'have not a clue.', '2005-10-10 12:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773963, 242144, 43463, '<td valign="top">The strength of this photo is the smiles seen here of the subjects. Perfectly composed to just have these two subjects fill the frame and those wide open happy smiles make us smile too. Lighting is also very complementary to the image as that it illuminates their faces such that we can enjoy the smiles not just seen with their mouths but in their eyes as well.</td>', 'The strength of this photo is the smiles seen here of the subjects. Perfectly composed to just have these two subjects fill the frame and those wide open happy smiles make us smile too. Lighting is also very complementary to the image as that it illuminates their faces such that we can enjoy the smiles not just seen with their mouths but in their eyes as well.', '2005-10-10 12:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1773965, 241725, 43463, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture!!!! Perfect lighting, perfect expressions on the subjects and the action going on in this shot is sweet and endearing. Love the capture of the expressions and actions of these two cute boys/brothers hugging. I do recommend that the framing be tigther focused on these two boys who are your main subjects and less on the background which is not as appealing.</td>', 'Wonderful capture!!!! Perfect lighting, perfect expressions on the subjects and the action going on in this shot is sweet and endearing. Love the capture of the expressions and actions of these two cute boys/brothers hugging. I do recommend that the framing be tigther focused on these two boys who are your main subjects and less on the background which is not as appealing.', '2005-10-10 12:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
