(1774261, 241731, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a really good capture of the Blue Angels. There seems to be a bit of a halo around the planes, so you might want to make a separate layer of just the planes to do whatever sharpening and dodging you like -- that way, it won''t affect the sky around them. Still, very nice shot!</td>', 'This is a really good capture of the Blue Angels. There seems to be a bit of a halo around the planes, so you might want to make a separate layer of just the planes to do whatever sharpening and dodging you like -- that way, it won''t affect the sky around them. Still, very nice shot!', '2005-10-10 14:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
