(1774308, 241007, 29241, '<td valign="top">The lines are great. Colors are very nice. Those 4 white pumkins kind of distract me a little bit. Otherwise, this is a very nice  photograph. Bumping up to 8.</td>', 'The lines are great. Colors are very nice. Those 4 white pumkins kind of distract me a little bit. Otherwise, this is a very nice  photograph. Bumping up to 8.', '2005-10-10 14:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
