(1774421, 241990, 39664, '<td valign="top">What a great concept and take on the challenge!  <br/> <br/>The sky looks very ominous so  I think I would have preferred it in color.  You have some digital haloing effects between the hillside and the skylines and a lot of digital noise in the clouds (midtones).<br/> <br/>I would be ultra-p-o-ed to have been in that traffic....sure there was tons of roadrage!</td>', 'What a great concept and take on the challenge!   The sky looks very ominous so  I think I would have preferred it in color.  You have some digital haloing effects between the hillside and the skylines and a lot of digital noise in the clouds (midtones). I would be ultra-p-o-ed to have been in that traffic....sure there was tons of roadrage!', '2005-10-10 16:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
