(1774569, 241939, 39664, '<td valign="top">Looks like this is a step back in time....all the cars I see are old....even the bikes look retro-70''s ish.  U used to have a Schwinn with a banana seat just like that one on the left but it had streamers on the handlebars.  Technically, this photo needs work.......you applied a blur that takes away from the photo rather than adding to it, IMHO. And there are several distracting hot spots that draw the eye to them rather than the subject.</td>', 'Looks like this is a step back in time....all the cars I see are old....even the bikes look retro-70''s ish.  U used to have a Schwinn with a banana seat just like that one on the left but it had streamers on the handlebars.  Technically, this photo needs work.......you applied a blur that takes away from the photo rather than adding to it, IMHO. And there are several distracting hot spots that draw the eye to them rather than the subject.', '2005-10-10 16:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1774570, 240189, 39664, '<td valign="top">This is a great candid shot.  It tilts to the right some, which you could have fixed in post processing.<br/> <br/>On the humorous side.....he is grabbing his butt when he should be grabbing that mask so it doesn''t get ripped off his face on entry!  LOL</td>', 'This is a great candid shot.  It tilts to the right some, which you could have fixed in post processing. On the humorous side.....he is grabbing his butt when he should be grabbing that mask so it doesn''t get ripped off his face on entry!  LOL', '2005-10-10 16:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
