(1775374, 241998, 43463, '<td valign="top">Wonderful action shot. Great capture of people jumping for joy. That is this photo''s strength. It''s weakness is that the viewers do not get to see the facial expressions on the jumpers. It would have made this photo all the more exceptional if the viewers could connect to the action by way of seeing the joyful/happy expressions on the three main subjects.</td>', 'Wonderful action shot. Great capture of people jumping for joy. That is this photo''s strength. It''s weakness is that the viewers do not get to see the facial expressions on the jumpers. It would have made this photo all the more exceptional if the viewers could connect to the action by way of seeing the joyful/happy expressions on the three main subjects.', '2005-10-10 23:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
