(1775392, 241468, 43463, '<td valign="top">There is too much empty space surrounding the two main subjects that does nothing to compliment the image overall. A closer zoom/crop focusing on just the bride and groom (say a shot from the shoulders up) would have greatly strengthened the image and made this scene less busy - especially with all the bubbles floating around which makes the eye dizzy. Lastly, it is always best to wait for the moment - and by that I mean waiting to capture a good facial expression as well as action taking place is sometimes all it takes to get a really good shot instead of an O.K. shot.</td>', 'There is too much empty space surrounding the two main subjects that does nothing to compliment the image overall. A closer zoom/crop focusing on just the bride and groom (say a shot from the shoulders up) would have greatly strengthened the image and made this scene less busy - especially with all the bubbles floating around which makes the eye dizzy. Lastly, it is always best to wait for the moment - and by that I mean waiting to capture a good facial expression as well as action taking place is sometimes all it takes to get a really good shot instead of an O.K. shot.', '2005-10-10 23:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
