(1776109, 241796, 36499, '<td valign="top">very energetic image here! good color and focus. only nit picks are: subject is dark(lighten brush might help this) and the crop. i would have cropped a bit more from the left to take out what looks to be a net(?) good luck :o) ~~Cher~~</td>', 'very energetic image here! good color and focus. only nit picks are: subject is dark(lighten brush might help this) and the crop. i would have cropped a bit more from the left to take out what looks to be a net(?) good luck :o) ~~Cher~~', '2005-10-11 10:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1776111, 242077, 35545, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea and the picture here, but the house in the background is a little too much.  This might have been a good time to use one of the blur filters as long as we have the advanced editing rules.</td>', 'I really like the idea and the picture here, but the house in the background is a little too much.  This might have been a good time to use one of the blur filters as long as we have the advanced editing rules.', '2005-10-11 10:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1776113, 242098, 30364, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this image.  There''s so little in it, yet it is filled with interest and appeal.  Not sure if it''s all pure reflection or a bit of trickery, but either way it''s fabulous.  The juxtaposition of the exuberantly embracing couple &amp; the carefully separated waiting commuters is really very clever.  How I wish this would ribbon!   9.</td>', 'Absolutely love this image.  There''s so little in it, yet it is filled with interest and appeal.  Not sure if it''s all pure reflection or a bit of trickery, but either way it''s fabulous.  The juxtaposition of the exuberantly embracing couple & the carefully separated waiting commuters is really very clever.  How I wish this would ribbon!   9.', '2005-10-11 10:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
