(1776124, 241670, 36499, '<td valign="top">ummm...no thanks...i dont dare to ;)<br/> <br/> what a great spooky image you got. Im sure your getting "this is overprocessed" (as I am) but i dont think this photo would have the same emotive qualities that it does now. so IMHO this is very well done. Im not sure if i like the slant of this tho. still a 9 from me and good luck! :o)~~Cher~~</td>', 'ummm...no thanks...i dont dare to ;)  what a great spooky image you got. Im sure your getting "this is overprocessed" (as I am) but i dont think this photo would have the same emotive qualities that it does now. so IMHO this is very well done. Im not sure if i like the slant of this tho. still a 9 from me and good luck! :o)~~Cher~~', '2005-10-11 10:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1776129, 241667, 36499, '<td valign="top">this is one of the best fall macro photos i have seen in a very long time.  very nice processing. gotta give this a 10 as i cant find a single thing wrong with it! CONGRATS on a wonderful image and i hope to see this at the top! :o) ~~Cher~~</td>', 'this is one of the best fall macro photos i have seen in a very long time.  very nice processing. gotta give this a 10 as i cant find a single thing wrong with it! CONGRATS on a wonderful image and i hope to see this at the top! :o) ~~Cher~~', '2005-10-11 10:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
