(1777184, 242234, 37875, '<td valign="top">nicely composed shot of people having a good time.  the image appears to be quite grainy, probably because of the night shot.  i wonder how this would have looked opening up your shutter and stopping down your apeture (hope i got that right!) to get a longer-exposed action shot, with all the cool colors.</td>', 'nicely composed shot of people having a good time.  the image appears to be quite grainy, probably because of the night shot.  i wonder how this would have looked opening up your shutter and stopping down your apeture (hope i got that right!) to get a longer-exposed action shot, with all the cool colors.', '2005-10-11 18:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
