(1777204, 242057, 37875, '<td valign="top">what a spectacular flight shot!  it looks like the camera focused on the branch and pvc pipe instead of the bird, though.  such a shame!  and with such vivid colors, too!  groovy wing span, and groovy shadows too.</td>', 'what a spectacular flight shot!  it looks like the camera focused on the branch and pvc pipe instead of the bird, though.  such a shame!  and with such vivid colors, too!  groovy wing span, and groovy shadows too.', '2005-10-11 18:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
