(1777208, 242200, 37875, '<td valign="top">i don''t know if you are using a blur effect or if the model is a bit out of focus, but the blur detracts from the photo just a bit, in my eye.  the lighting is nice on her, and i love the light you captured in her eyes.  charming smile, too.  i also notice that as i look at this image, i''m self-cropping it to be a tighter shot of the model (less on top &amp; rt side).  a nice soft image.</td>', 'i don''t know if you are using a blur effect or if the model is a bit out of focus, but the blur detracts from the photo just a bit, in my eye.  the lighting is nice on her, and i love the light you captured in her eyes.  charming smile, too.  i also notice that as i look at this image, i''m self-cropping it to be a tighter shot of the model (less on top & rt side).  a nice soft image.', '2005-10-11 18:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
