(1777222, 241667, 327, '<td valign="top">Really nice-love the color depth, light.</td>', 'Really nice-love the color depth, light.', '2005-10-11 18:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777223, 241875, 37875, '<td valign="top">vivid reds and blues, but not so much with that lawn.  i would be interested in seeing how this photo would be with different lighting...like around sunset, when you get that soft, warm light that really enhances colors...</td>', 'vivid reds and blues, but not so much with that lawn.  i would be interested in seeing how this photo would be with different lighting...like around sunset, when you get that soft, warm light that really enhances colors...', '2005-10-11 18:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777224, 242099, 37875, '<td valign="top">interesting compesition, focusing on the hand on her back.  i would have liked to see greater contrast in your b&amp;w, so that the dress details really pop and his hand really stands out.</td>', 'interesting compesition, focusing on the hand on her back.  i would have liked to see greater contrast in your b&w, so that the dress details really pop and his hand really stands out.', '2005-10-11 18:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777226, 241004, 37875, '<td valign="top">hooray for fire fighters!<br/>nice color in the shot. i wonder how this could have been taken to add more excitement or energy to the image?</td>', 'hooray for fire fighters!nice color in the shot. i wonder how this could have been taken to add more excitement or energy to the image?', '2005-10-11 18:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777227, 242148, 37875, '<td valign="top">very nice picture!  i like the layers of landscape thorugh the mist, and all those balloons rising is something to see as well. nicely composed.</td>', 'very nice picture!  i like the layers of landscape thorugh the mist, and all those balloons rising is something to see as well. nicely composed.', '2005-10-11 18:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777228, 242227, 37875, '<td valign="top">i wonder how this picture would have looked with a dark brown background instead of black, to highlight the fall colors?  it also looks like there''s a string or seam behind the second leaf from the top on the left side.  interesting idea for a shot, with the leaves flitting about the boquet.</td>', 'i wonder how this picture would have looked with a dark brown background instead of black, to highlight the fall colors?  it also looks like there''s a string or seam behind the second leaf from the top on the left side.  interesting idea for a shot, with the leaves flitting about the boquet.', '2005-10-11 18:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777229, 241219, 37875, '<td valign="top">i don''t know if this was intentional but this image is really dark, with a dark grey film over it.  the red of the wine picking up the hilights from the plastic is a nice touch...</td>', 'i don''t know if this was intentional but this image is really dark, with a dark grey film over it.  the red of the wine picking up the hilights from the plastic is a nice touch...', '2005-10-11 18:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777230, 241683, 37875, '<td valign="top">oh my!  that would be a big ol'' sloppy kiss!  i love the expression--he looks so gosh darned happy to see you!  i would love to see this shot taken with the lighting set at an angle to the subject and camera, and with richer color tones.  it looks like the flash is affecting the eyes in the shot, and the dog (dark fur, white fur, and tongue) appears to be bleached out just a bit by the lighting.</td>', 'oh my!  that would be a big ol'' sloppy kiss!  i love the expression--he looks so gosh darned happy to see you!  i would love to see this shot taken with the lighting set at an angle to the subject and camera, and with richer color tones.  it looks like the flash is affecting the eyes in the shot, and the dog (dark fur, white fur, and tongue) appears to be bleached out just a bit by the lighting.', '2005-10-11 18:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777231, 241801, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, great tones.</td>', 'Nice capture, great tones.', '2005-10-11 18:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777232, 241568, 37875, '<td valign="top">only 77 more days???  panic attack!  ; )<br/>great idea, cute picture.  would like to see them sitting on different fabric...that neutral print doesn''t quite go with the ho ho ho, if you know what i mean...<br/>nicely lit and composed.</td>', 'only 77 more days???  panic attack!  ; )great idea, cute picture.  would like to see them sitting on different fabric...that neutral print doesn''t quite go with the ho ho ho, if you know what i mean...nicely lit and composed.', '2005-10-11 18:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777233, 241892, 37875, '<td valign="top">lovely lit, interesting landscape.  makes me want to celebrate mother nature in all her mystical glory.  beautiful soft colors, beautiful light, lovely mist.  like how the green in that tree still stands out.  very nicely done.</td>', 'lovely lit, interesting landscape.  makes me want to celebrate mother nature in all her mystical glory.  beautiful soft colors, beautiful light, lovely mist.  like how the green in that tree still stands out.  very nicely done.', '2005-10-11 18:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777234, 242228, 37875, '<td valign="top">nice delayed exposure for the water blur.  i''d love to see this with the colors just a bit richer...</td>', 'nice delayed exposure for the water blur.  i''d love to see this with the colors just a bit richer...', '2005-10-11 18:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777235, 241886, 37875, '<td valign="top">nice framing with the model and their time.  congrats on such a great time, too!</td>', 'nice framing with the model and their time.  congrats on such a great time, too!', '2005-10-11 18:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777237, 242198, 37875, '<td valign="top">ha! i love it! the image is so soft and inviting, with such manly-yet-attractive colors.  like how the border ties in with the box color, too.  this should be an ad!  : )<br/>nicely done!</td>', 'ha! i love it! the image is so soft and inviting, with such manly-yet-attractive colors.  like how the border ties in with the box color, too.  this should be an ad!  : )nicely done!', '2005-10-11 18:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777238, 241468, 19831, '<td valign="top">A very nice moment to capture. Fits the challenge well. Focus seems off though. Also it looks like, if possible, if you would of taken a step or two to the right, it would have centered the cake between the couple, that would be pretty cool.</td>', 'A very nice moment to capture. Fits the challenge well. Focus seems off though. Also it looks like, if possible, if you would of taken a step or two to the right, it would have centered the cake between the couple, that would be pretty cool.', '2005-10-11 18:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777239, 242114, 37875, '<td valign="top">a cupcake?  for me?  for no reason?  you shouldn''t have!  (secretly pleased and doing a happy dance!)<br/>love the idea, love the colors, love the composition.  would like to see different lighting (and a little less wind, from the looks of that flame...)</td>', 'a cupcake?  for me?  for no reason?  you shouldn''t have!  (secretly pleased and doing a happy dance!)love the idea, love the colors, love the composition.  would like to see different lighting (and a little less wind, from the looks of that flame...)', '2005-10-11 18:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777240, 241178, 37875, '<td valign="top">i''m finding that my eye has a hard time focusing in on this picture.  it is so colorful, with the reds and blues so saturated.  my eye wants to focus in on the red flower about two thirds of the way up on the right side, but the detail in the flower has been swallowed up by the red.  then i find my eye wanting to focus where there are no flowers--in the large bap between the two white stalks.  i would like to see how this image would have turned out with a shorter dof, so that the rear flowers would soften yet with that same strong impact of color.</td>', 'i''m finding that my eye has a hard time focusing in on this picture.  it is so colorful, with the reds and blues so saturated.  my eye wants to focus in on the red flower about two thirds of the way up on the right side, but the detail in the flower has been swallowed up by the red.  then i find my eye wanting to focus where there are no flowers--in the large bap between the two white stalks.  i would like to see how this image would have turned out with a shorter dof, so that the rear flowers would soften yet with that same strong impact of color.', '2005-10-11 18:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777241, 242138, 37875, '<td valign="top">the desaturation is interesting...drawing the viewer''s eye into what the fanatic is excited about.</td>', 'the desaturation is interesting...drawing the viewer''s eye into what the fanatic is excited about.', '2005-10-11 18:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777242, 241662, 37875, '<td valign="top">a sweet image.  i wonder how this would have looked with a different dof, so that the rest of the world just faded away in their kiss...</td>', 'a sweet image.  i wonder how this would have looked with a different dof, so that the rest of the world just faded away in their kiss...', '2005-10-11 18:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777243, 242149, 37875, '<td valign="top">fun shot.  nice composition.  with the clock being fake, i wonder how the image would have looked with the focus reversed...</td>', 'fun shot.  nice composition.  with the clock being fake, i wonder how the image would have looked with the focus reversed...', '2005-10-11 18:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777244, 241900, 37875, '<td valign="top">poor prison doggie!!  quick!  make a run for it...<br/>: )<br/>fun composition, nicely executed.</td>', 'poor prison doggie!!  quick!  make a run for it...: )fun composition, nicely executed.', '2005-10-11 18:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777245, 242222, 37875, '<td valign="top">the angle from which the photo was shot has the hanging wreath off-center.  i keep wanting to push it over to the right to center it out...</td>', 'the angle from which the photo was shot has the hanging wreath off-center.  i keep wanting to push it over to the right to center it out...', '2005-10-11 18:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777246, 242131, 37875, '<td valign="top">great moment to capture!  i''d love to see this picture with richer colors.</td>', 'great moment to capture!  i''d love to see this picture with richer colors.', '2005-10-11 18:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777247, 242137, 37875, '<td valign="top">what a great moment to capture!  the glamour, the emotion, the colors, the lights, it all makes for a really nice candid photo.</td>', 'what a great moment to capture!  the glamour, the emotion, the colors, the lights, it all makes for a really nice candid photo.', '2005-10-11 18:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777249, 241679, 37875, '<td valign="top">eew!  hear hear!  ; )<br/>the picture comes across as looking a bit overexposed, with some blown out white areas at the door of the wc and in the forest beyond...<br/>creative idea!</td>', 'eew!  hear hear!  ; )the picture comes across as looking a bit overexposed, with some blown out white areas at the door of the wc and in the forest beyond...creative idea!', '2005-10-11 18:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777250, 242224, 37875, '<td valign="top">hooray for the end of the work day!<br/>like the clock''s placement and composition of the photo.  like how the yellow stands out, and the bluish tint to the rest of the photo.  creative concept.</td>', 'hooray for the end of the work day!like the clock''s placement and composition of the photo.  like how the yellow stands out, and the bluish tint to the rest of the photo.  creative concept.', '2005-10-11 18:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777251, 241293, 37875, '<td valign="top">reminds me of younger days full of love and wonder for unicorns and pegasuses (pegasai?)...<br/>there''s something really appealing about this photo at that level for me.  i''m sad to see that some of the color pixils are blown out as white, though--perhaps cloning can help wih that?  love the star things throughout the background, and the shimmer trail.  very interesting pic.</td>', 'reminds me of younger days full of love and wonder for unicorns and pegasuses (pegasai?)...there''s something really appealing about this photo at that level for me.  i''m sad to see that some of the color pixils are blown out as white, though--perhaps cloning can help wih that?  love the star things throughout the background, and the shimmer trail.  very interesting pic.', '2005-10-11 18:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777252, 242235, 37875, '<td valign="top">the pier is very dark in the shot.  i would like to see this shot with more even lighting.</td>', 'the pier is very dark in the shot.  i would like to see this shot with more even lighting.', '2005-10-11 18:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777253, 241974, 37875, '<td valign="top">and thank goodness, too!  : )<br/>i wonder how this image would have looked with more diffused lighting to bring out the shadows and tones in the pic.  i also wonder how it would look with a richer colored background.  the nuts blend in with the basket, and that blends in to the background color.  it does make your apple pop out, though!  nice composition.</td>', 'and thank goodness, too!  : )i wonder how this image would have looked with more diffused lighting to bring out the shadows and tones in the pic.  i also wonder how it would look with a richer colored background.  the nuts blend in with the basket, and that blends in to the background color.  it does make your apple pop out, though!  nice composition.', '2005-10-11 18:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777254, 239674, 37875, '<td valign="top">fun picture!  like the composition.  the model does not stand out as much against the water, though, due to the evening light.  i would love to have seen this shot with different lighting to really have her pop out of the image like the star she''s going to be.</td>', 'fun picture!  like the composition.  the model does not stand out as much against the water, though, due to the evening light.  i would love to have seen this shot with different lighting to really have her pop out of the image like the star she''s going to be.', '2005-10-11 18:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777255, 242089, 37875, '<td valign="top">this image makes me want to park my car in a garage!  ; )<br/>lots of grey tones, lots of tiny bird images.  in my eye, the image loses its power because it is so wide a shot.  perhaps a tighter shot of one of those wires with the birds would make me really focus in and want to know what those birds are meeting about...</td>', 'this image makes me want to park my car in a garage!  ; )lots of grey tones, lots of tiny bird images.  in my eye, the image loses its power because it is so wide a shot.  perhaps a tighter shot of one of those wires with the birds would make me really focus in and want to know what those birds are meeting about...', '2005-10-11 18:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777256, 242104, 37875, '<td valign="top">nice job of capturing the reflection in the mirror while keeping the lighting out of the reflection.</td>', 'nice job of capturing the reflection in the mirror while keeping the lighting out of the reflection.', '2005-10-11 18:42:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1777257, 241948, 37875, '<td valign="top">pretty horse, awkward lighting. the left half of its face disappears into shadow, and the colors of the surroundings look washed out by the sun.  i wonder what this would look like shot from other angles more complimentary to the natural lighting?</td>', 'pretty horse, awkward lighting. the left half of its face disappears into shadow, and the colors of the surroundings look washed out by the sun.  i wonder what this would look like shot from other angles more complimentary to the natural lighting?', '2005-10-11 18:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777258, 240637, 37875, '<td valign="top">nice soft nature shot.  beautiful pinks and peaches, like the mist, and how you can still see the green in the foreground.  almost would like to see a bit more contrast between landscape layers...almost.</td>', 'nice soft nature shot.  beautiful pinks and peaches, like the mist, and how you can still see the green in the foreground.  almost would like to see a bit more contrast between landscape layers...almost.', '2005-10-11 18:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777259, 241634, 37875, '<td valign="top">pretty amazing trick, there!  nice colors, but low on energy.  i wonder how this shot could have been reframed to emphasize the excitement of the activity?</td>', 'pretty amazing trick, there!  nice colors, but low on energy.  i wonder how this shot could have been reframed to emphasize the excitement of the activity?', '2005-10-11 18:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777260, 239739, 37875, '<td valign="top">wish i could see that other foot!  if she was suspended in air, that would have been a cool touch for this shot.  like the happy go lucky feel, and the color of the sweatshirt with the jeans.</td>', 'wish i could see that other foot!  if she was suspended in air, that would have been a cool touch for this shot.  like the happy go lucky feel, and the color of the sweatshirt with the jeans.', '2005-10-11 18:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777261, 242229, 37875, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo, with its lines, architecture, and shades of gray.  the image, with the title, seems to evoke a feeling of mourning or respectful remembrance rather than celebration, however.  stunning image.  very well done.</td>', 'beautiful photo, with its lines, architecture, and shades of gray.  the image, with the title, seems to evoke a feeling of mourning or respectful remembrance rather than celebration, however.  stunning image.  very well done.', '2005-10-11 18:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777262, 241796, 37875, '<td valign="top">great shot.  love the engery, the color, the composition, the cloud.  i find the bars in the lower left corner a bit distracting, but really like this picture very much!  nicely done.</td>', 'great shot.  love the engery, the color, the composition, the cloud.  i find the bars in the lower left corner a bit distracting, but really like this picture very much!  nicely done.', '2005-10-11 18:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777263, 241894, 37875, '<td valign="top">boy, i wish the aftermath of my nights out ended like that, instead of me being wheelchaired to my car with my head in a trashcan!  ; )<br/>nice choice of pink table cover and green bottle...they compliment each other well.  i gues my biggest issue is that this still life is so calm and composed for "the aftermath".  i''d expect a wine stain on the cork, at least...<br/>very nicely composed shot.  like how the black background gets divided by the bottle and candle holder...</td>', 'boy, i wish the aftermath of my nights out ended like that, instead of me being wheelchaired to my car with my head in a trashcan!  ; )nice choice of pink table cover and green bottle...they compliment each other well.  i gues my biggest issue is that this still life is so calm and composed for "the aftermath".  i''d expect a wine stain on the cork, at least...very nicely composed shot.  like how the black background gets divided by the bottle and candle holder...', '2005-10-11 18:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777264, 241024, 37875, '<td valign="top">nice composition and a beautiful model.  unfortunately, your human form is getting washed out by the overexposure.  also, i find the writing on the lingerie to be distracting.</td>', 'nice composition and a beautiful model.  unfortunately, your human form is getting washed out by the overexposure.  also, i find the writing on the lingerie to be distracting.', '2005-10-11 18:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777265, 241668, 37875, '<td valign="top">such a beautiful photo...wish i could see it with sharper focus.  like the choice of color treatment, like the action.  makes me want to see what the one girl is looking at...</td>', 'such a beautiful photo...wish i could see it with sharper focus.  like the choice of color treatment, like the action.  makes me want to see what the one girl is looking at...', '2005-10-11 18:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777266, 242144, 37875, '<td valign="top">cute couple!  softer light and a down angle for the shot would call less attention to their noses.  great light in the eyes, and great contrast.  good luck to them!</td>', 'cute couple!  softer light and a down angle for the shot would call less attention to their noses.  great light in the eyes, and great contrast.  good luck to them!', '2005-10-11 18:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777267, 242095, 37875, '<td valign="top">hooray for life on the bay!  like the composition with the crowd, then the boat rising up, the the bridge.  looks like there was a bit of fog...no surprise there!  ; )<br/>a festive photo.</td>', 'hooray for life on the bay!  like the composition with the crowd, then the boat rising up, the the bridge.  looks like there was a bit of fog...no surprise there!  ; )a festive photo.', '2005-10-11 18:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777269, 242096, 37875, '<td valign="top">let''s hear it for hips!  hooray!<br/>interesting costumes to photograph!  the dancer in red really jumps out of the image.  i wonder how this image would look with different framing or crops...drawing the eye to different places of importance within the image (e.g. cropping to two dancers, including more torso and less skirt, etc...)  fun shot!</td>', 'let''s hear it for hips!  hooray!interesting costumes to photograph!  the dancer in red really jumps out of the image.  i wonder how this image would look with different framing or crops...drawing the eye to different places of importance within the image (e.g. cropping to two dancers, including more torso and less skirt, etc...)  fun shot!', '2005-10-11 18:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777270, 242043, 37875, '<td valign="top">i appreciate the sentiment, but would have felt it more had the shot been of good friends having good times (taking a shot, at the 18th hole, at the 18th watering hole...).  this message gets diluted by the large-scale shot of the green.  glorious greens and rusts in the shot.  nice misty day.</td>', 'i appreciate the sentiment, but would have felt it more had the shot been of good friends having good times (taking a shot, at the 18th hole, at the 18th watering hole...).  this message gets diluted by the large-scale shot of the green.  glorious greens and rusts in the shot.  nice misty day.', '2005-10-11 18:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777271, 242232, 37875, '<td valign="top">i would like to have seen this shot taken from a down angle of her looking up.  in this image, her nostril becomes a prominent feature.</td>', 'i would like to have seen this shot taken from a down angle of her looking up.  in this image, her nostril becomes a prominent feature.', '2005-10-11 18:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777272, 242139, 37875, '<td valign="top">i find that the wine disappears into the background, and the wine glass casts a shadow on the bread.  the wine ties in nicely with the color of the bible.  i would be interested in seeing this shot lit a bit differently to better highlight the wine glass and reduce that shadow effect...</td>', 'i find that the wine disappears into the background, and the wine glass casts a shadow on the bread.  the wine ties in nicely with the color of the bible.  i would be interested in seeing this shot lit a bit differently to better highlight the wine glass and reduce that shadow effect...', '2005-10-11 18:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777273, 241928, 37875, '<td valign="top">the reflection off the green mask is nice...wish the pink and white one had more reflection to help it pop, too!  groovy masks, and great memories of my last trip to new orleans.</td>', 'the reflection off the green mask is nice...wish the pink and white one had more reflection to help it pop, too!  groovy masks, and great memories of my last trip to new orleans.', '2005-10-11 18:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777274, 241800, 37875, '<td valign="top">the distortion from the lens detracts from the photo...the girl ends up looking like she''s crying on my screen.  and the composition is so cool, and she''s got some huge pumpkins, i know she''s not really crying...</td>', 'the distortion from the lens detracts from the photo...the girl ends up looking like she''s crying on my screen.  and the composition is so cool, and she''s got some huge pumpkins, i know she''s not really crying...', '2005-10-11 18:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777275, 242079, 37875, '<td valign="top">wish the focus could have been on the guy cheering, instead of the person turned towards him...would have had much more impact as an image.</td>', 'wish the focus could have been on the guy cheering, instead of the person turned towards him...would have had much more impact as an image.', '2005-10-11 18:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777277, 241854, 37875, '<td valign="top">fun picture, fun composition, i would like to see how this could have been with different lighting...it comes across as a snapshot with a flash used.</td>', 'fun picture, fun composition, i would like to see how this could have been with different lighting...it comes across as a snapshot with a flash used.', '2005-10-11 18:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777278, 241468, 37875, '<td valign="top">interesting effect with the bubbles.  the groom''s face appears to be out of focus?  wish i could see this with softer lighting, a sharper crop (to cut out that photographer on the right), and crisper image...</td>', 'interesting effect with the bubbles.  the groom''s face appears to be out of focus?  wish i could see this with softer lighting, a sharper crop (to cut out that photographer on the right), and crisper image...', '2005-10-11 18:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777279, 242212, 37875, '<td valign="top">sparkly tulle!  i wonder what would have happened had the ring be set at a slightly upward angle so that it catches the light.  the way it is, that diamond''s nosing into the tulle.</td>', 'sparkly tulle!  i wonder what would have happened had the ring be set at a slightly upward angle so that it catches the light.  the way it is, that diamond''s nosing into the tulle.', '2005-10-11 18:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777280, 241890, 37875, '<td valign="top">i like this idea.  pretty rain of daisies.  there''s a tall grass that''s blurred in the front that distracts a bit...could clone it out, probably.  i love the creativity of this piece, the colors, and the composition.  the backshot of the model with her hand up testing the rain is a great touch.  the picture feels a bit bright, but very nicely done.</td>', 'i like this idea.  pretty rain of daisies.  there''s a tall grass that''s blurred in the front that distracts a bit...could clone it out, probably.  i love the creativity of this piece, the colors, and the composition.  the backshot of the model with her hand up testing the rain is a great touch.  the picture feels a bit bright, but very nicely done.', '2005-10-11 18:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777281, 241852, 37875, '<td valign="top">fun shot!  surreal tinge to the cloud colors..quite nice.  wish the foremost child was facing forward or more towards the camera...but great composition!  really enjoy this one.</td>', 'fun shot!  surreal tinge to the cloud colors..quite nice.  wish the foremost child was facing forward or more towards the camera...but great composition!  really enjoy this one.', '2005-10-11 18:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777282, 241667, 37875, '<td valign="top">oh. lovely.  like this very much.  great composition, color, and lighting.  nicely done.</td>', 'oh. lovely.  like this very much.  great composition, color, and lighting.  nicely done.', '2005-10-11 18:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777283, 241990, 37875, '<td valign="top">what a great concept!  i know i do a little happy dance when i see all the traffic heading the opposite direction...perfect for this challenge.<br/>the image looks a bit dark on my monitor, but from the headlights in the shot, it''s taken at dusk or dawn!  that sky shot and the composition is just terriffic.  may you finish high, my friend! (and i''ve only said that to one other person out of 1/3 of the shots so far...)  good luck!</td>', 'what a great concept!  i know i do a little happy dance when i see all the traffic heading the opposite direction...perfect for this challenge.the image looks a bit dark on my monitor, but from the headlights in the shot, it''s taken at dusk or dawn!  that sky shot and the composition is just terriffic.  may you finish high, my friend! (and i''ve only said that to one other person out of 1/3 of the shots so far...)  good luck!', '2005-10-11 18:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777284, 241921, 37875, '<td valign="top">i love the creativity of this picture.  great energy, like the composition, like the angle of the shot.  i would love to see this shot with the model holding still to keep the arms and hand in focus against that wonderfully blurred window.  the contrast of warm and cool colors works really well in this photo, too.  very nicely done!</td>', 'i love the creativity of this picture.  great energy, like the composition, like the angle of the shot.  i would love to see this shot with the model holding still to keep the arms and hand in focus against that wonderfully blurred window.  the contrast of warm and cool colors works really well in this photo, too.  very nicely done!', '2005-10-11 18:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777285, 241586, 37875, '<td valign="top">when i think of connections to celebrate, i think of people first off.  however, having a bridge to get to those people would be great to have!<br/>in terms of the photo only, it''s a very nice bridge shot.  the sunset peeking through the clouds and reflecting off the water is a nice touch, and i like it being off-center.  lovely sky captured, and lovely pastel colors.  there''s a point at your horizon line where the sky and sea blur, and seeing that with the rest of the horizon outlined makes my eye feel just a bit odd.  nice, soft-looking landscape and sky set against a crisp bridge image.</td>', 'when i think of connections to celebrate, i think of people first off.  however, having a bridge to get to those people would be great to have!in terms of the photo only, it''s a very nice bridge shot.  the sunset peeking through the clouds and reflecting off the water is a nice touch, and i like it being off-center.  lovely sky captured, and lovely pastel colors.  there''s a point at your horizon line where the sky and sea blur, and seeing that with the rest of the horizon outlined makes my eye feel just a bit odd.  nice, soft-looking landscape and sky set against a crisp bridge image.', '2005-10-11 18:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777286, 241830, 37875, '<td valign="top">like the effect on this picture...very appropriate for the subject.  going to the movies is always reason to celebrate for me!  : )</td>', 'like the effect on this picture...very appropriate for the subject.  going to the movies is always reason to celebrate for me!  : )', '2005-10-11 18:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777287, 242084, 37875, '<td valign="top">i think this is a graveyard, from the title.  there is no visible definition in the bottom third of the photo, though, and i think some detail would have made this image pop out a bit more.  i like the branches and the color of the sky, and i agree with your sentiment about enjoying life while you can!  : )</td>', 'i think this is a graveyard, from the title.  there is no visible definition in the bottom third of the photo, though, and i think some detail would have made this image pop out a bit more.  i like the branches and the color of the sky, and i agree with your sentiment about enjoying life while you can!  : )', '2005-10-11 18:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777288, 242141, 37875, '<td valign="top">were the pumpkins really that uniform a color?  they almost look painted, and that detracts from the image in my eye.  i like how your model contrasts against the setting with her bright, clear colors.</td>', 'were the pumpkins really that uniform a color?  they almost look painted, and that detracts from the image in my eye.  i like how your model contrasts against the setting with her bright, clear colors.', '2005-10-11 18:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777289, 241720, 37875, '<td valign="top">cute picture.  like the energy and composition.  like the black and white and yellow...although the feel like they are on the edge of being oversaturated.  fun pic.</td>', 'cute picture.  like the energy and composition.  like the black and white and yellow...although the feel like they are on the edge of being oversaturated.  fun pic.', '2005-10-11 18:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777290, 241801, 37875, '<td valign="top">cool shot!  wish that center person had more of a smile on her face, but i LOVE the action and the feeling of excitement in this shot!  i can just imagine them pouring out of the van and running over to the gate/field in anticipation of the big game...</td>', 'cool shot!  wish that center person had more of a smile on her face, but i LOVE the action and the feeling of excitement in this shot!  i can just imagine them pouring out of the van and running over to the gate/field in anticipation of the big game...', '2005-10-11 18:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
