(1777293, 241701, 37875, '<td valign="top">really emotive photo.  nice composition and use of shadow.  the emotion coming from this for me, though, is more like mourning a loss (the shattered debris in the foreground, contrasted with the unbroken glass, and the position of the model).  it''s beautiful, but it feels sad to me.</td>', 'really emotive photo.  nice composition and use of shadow.  the emotion coming from this for me, though, is more like mourning a loss (the shattered debris in the foreground, contrasted with the unbroken glass, and the position of the model).  it''s beautiful, but it feels sad to me.', '2005-10-11 18:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777294, 242060, 37875, '<td valign="top">fun!  in looking at this picture, the thing that immediatley jumps out at me is the guy dancing with the little girl.  i would have loved to see a picture of just those two charming people having a fun dance!</td>', 'fun!  in looking at this picture, the thing that immediatley jumps out at me is the guy dancing with the little girl.  i would have loved to see a picture of just those two charming people having a fun dance!', '2005-10-11 18:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
