(1777604, 241894, 45194, '<td valign="top">It''s a good photo but feels too staged.  If it looked a little more like it happened naturally I''d give it a 7.  Good quality though. - 6</td>', 'It''s a good photo but feels too staged.  If it looked a little more like it happened naturally I''d give it a 7.  Good quality though. - 6', '2005-10-11 21:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
