(1777606, 242237, 45194, '<td valign="top">I think I undrestand the effect you wanted but the hands in the way really detract from the picture.  Of course the Yankee''s getting knocked out of the playoffs brings a smile to my face and that''s worth 6.</td>', 'I think I undrestand the effect you wanted but the hands in the way really detract from the picture.  Of course the Yankee''s getting knocked out of the playoffs brings a smile to my face and that''s worth 6.', '2005-10-11 21:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
