(1777622, 241662, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice moment, I love the "feel" of this picture, is it a wedding shot?  It´s hard to tell since there are no flowers but I guess it doesn´t really matter.  Just to nitpick , the fringes of the dress that touch the ground on both her sides seem to have blown out highlights and a blue hue that isn´t very flattering.  Other than that tiny detail, nice work and very fitting for the challenge, 7 from me.</td>', 'Nice moment, I love the "feel" of this picture, is it a wedding shot?  It´s hard to tell since there are no flowers but I guess it doesn´t really matter.  Just to nitpick , the fringes of the dress that touch the ground on both her sides seem to have blown out highlights and a blue hue that isn´t very flattering.  Other than that tiny detail, nice work and very fitting for the challenge, 7 from me.', '2005-10-11 21:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
