(1777627, 241892, 45194, '<td valign="top">Outstanding shot!  I expect you''ll ribbon on this one.  Great job even if it is mariginal for the challenge topic.  Despite my not feeling it''s on topic much I gave it my highest rating.  Just too beautiful not to rate high. I gave it an 8.. Wouid have been 9 for me if I thought it was more on topic.  Again, beautiful shot!</td>', 'Outstanding shot!  I expect you''ll ribbon on this one.  Great job even if it is mariginal for the challenge topic.  Despite my not feeling it''s on topic much I gave it my highest rating.  Just too beautiful not to rate high. I gave it an 8.. Wouid have been 9 for me if I thought it was more on topic.  Again, beautiful shot!', '2005-10-11 21:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777628, 242141, 35786, '<td valign="top">she looks so solemn, hardly celebrating! ;0)<br/>Nice pick, although I might tone down the color- the orange is a bit too much. Maybe do at half saturation?</td>', 'she looks so solemn, hardly celebrating! ;0)Nice pick, although I might tone down the color- the orange is a bit too much. Maybe do at half saturation?', '2005-10-11 21:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777630, 241826, 45194, '<td valign="top">A superb shot because I can''t tell if it''s staged or if you just happened to be in the right place at the right time.  Outstanding either way.  8</td>', 'A superb shot because I can''t tell if it''s staged or if you just happened to be in the right place at the right time.  Outstanding either way.  8', '2005-10-11 21:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777722, 242093, 42638, '<td valign="top">This is just fantastic. Love the moment of explosion! Great capture!</td>', 'This is just fantastic. Love the moment of explosion! Great capture!', '2005-10-11 22:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777725, 241894, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very nice, the glowing wick is an excellent touch!</td>', 'Very nice, the glowing wick is an excellent touch!', '2005-10-11 22:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777728, 242137, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very Nice. Love all the colors in this and her expression is fantastic.</td>', 'Very Nice. Love all the colors in this and her expression is fantastic.', '2005-10-11 22:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777735, 241747, 3818, '<td valign="top">The low wide angle viewpoint works esp. well here, but the dark edges (from editing?) around the people''s heads is a bit strange looking. Comp could be stronger (the person cut in half on the right is a bit bothersome) and the lack of happy expressions doesn''t exactly shout out the theme of celebration, but all in all a good effort. Exposure is excellent for a tough lighting situation~</td>', 'The low wide angle viewpoint works esp. well here, but the dark edges (from editing?) around the people''s heads is a bit strange looking. Comp could be stronger (the person cut in half on the right is a bit bothersome) and the lack of happy expressions doesn''t exactly shout out the theme of celebration, but all in all a good effort. Exposure is excellent for a tough lighting situation~', '2005-10-11 22:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777745, 240886, 3818, '<td valign="top">For some reason, I get the feeling this is a merge of two different photos, but I reserve the right to be wrong! ;-) The expression on the girl certainly tells of joy and the celebration of youth and vitality and, um, nature (?). If it''s a comp, it''s fairly well done. I''m guessing if it''s not a comp, it looks a little "unnatural" because of the use of a fill in flash, perhaps? Anyhow, it''s a fun subject and an enjoyable photo~ :)</td>', 'For some reason, I get the feeling this is a merge of two different photos, but I reserve the right to be wrong! ;-) The expression on the girl certainly tells of joy and the celebration of youth and vitality and, um, nature (?). If it''s a comp, it''s fairly well done. I''m guessing if it''s not a comp, it looks a little "unnatural" because of the use of a fill in flash, perhaps? Anyhow, it''s a fun subject and an enjoyable photo~ :)', '2005-10-11 23:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777752, 241886, 3818, '<td valign="top">This photo certainly tells a story. I like that you included the timer showing his finish time and the onlooker who is happy for this fellow. Looks like it was a personal triumph. I''m thinking the dof might be better if the photo was either all in focus or the background a lot more out of focus. The CW tilt is a little bothersome, but not terribly so. Exposure is very good and his expression is priceless~ :-)</td>', 'This photo certainly tells a story. I like that you included the timer showing his finish time and the onlooker who is happy for this fellow. Looks like it was a personal triumph. I''m thinking the dof might be better if the photo was either all in focus or the background a lot more out of focus. The CW tilt is a little bothersome, but not terribly so. Exposure is very good and his expression is priceless~ :-)', '2005-10-11 23:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777759, 242194, 3818, '<td valign="top">This should be a top finisher! Excellent in every way. The black and white works well here. Comp is very nice and a perfect capture of a moment in time. A fraction of a second before or after and you might have missed this. Kudos for a great photo...tack sharp where it needs to be, nicely blurred background...priceless!</td>', 'This should be a top finisher! Excellent in every way. The black and white works well here. Comp is very nice and a perfect capture of a moment in time. A fraction of a second before or after and you might have missed this. Kudos for a great photo...tack sharp where it needs to be, nicely blurred background...priceless!', '2005-10-11 23:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777774, 241990, 3818, '<td valign="top">LOL! The element of celebration is implied, since we can''t see your face (well, assuming you are on the right side of the road, LOL!). I love the humor of this photo...it''s something most of us can relate to. The S curve of the road is especially nice and you did well capturing enough depth of field throughout. Good for you for taking the time to stop and photograph this scene. A lot of us would have missed the opportunity~</td>', 'LOL! The element of celebration is implied, since we can''t see your face (well, assuming you are on the right side of the road, LOL!). I love the humor of this photo...it''s something most of us can relate to. The S curve of the road is especially nice and you did well capturing enough depth of field throughout. Good for you for taking the time to stop and photograph this scene. A lot of us would have missed the opportunity~', '2005-10-11 23:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777785, 241890, 3818, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is such a wonderfully creative idea, beautifully executed and one that deserves a high score. I''ll bet this ends up in the "how did you do that" section. My only nit is that I think it might have worked just a bit better to have included the girl''s face in the shot, especially if her expression were one of joyful excitement. But just the same, it''s a well conceived image that should get a good number of votes~</td>', 'Oh, this is such a wonderfully creative idea, beautifully executed and one that deserves a high score. I''ll bet this ends up in the "how did you do that" section. My only nit is that I think it might have worked just a bit better to have included the girl''s face in the shot, especially if her expression were one of joyful excitement. But just the same, it''s a well conceived image that should get a good number of votes~', '2005-10-11 23:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777801, 242230, 3818, '<td valign="top">This is such a wonderfully touching image, though I would say it speaks more of their sibling relationship (with two very different moods here) than of "celebration". The comp is good, though a little unbalanced. Would have been nice to include a little more of the girl''s head and hair but it''s not a major problem. A little faster shutter speed might have helped to avoid the slight blur that''s noticable on both their faces. Looks like you are working with a controlled lighting setup, so a little more practice will go a long way in getting the right shutter/aperture combination.</td>', 'This is such a wonderfully touching image, though I would say it speaks more of their sibling relationship (with two very different moods here) than of "celebration". The comp is good, though a little unbalanced. Would have been nice to include a little more of the girl''s head and hair but it''s not a major problem. A little faster shutter speed might have helped to avoid the slight blur that''s noticable on both their faces. Looks like you are working with a controlled lighting setup, so a little more practice will go a long way in getting the right shutter/aperture combination.', '2005-10-11 23:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777815, 241701, 3818, '<td valign="top">This image seems more sad than a celebration, but it is quite excellent nonetheless. The feeling I get is that this man is a widower remembering the date with sadness rather than joy. It is a powerful image showing the other side of celebration, which can be loneliness. It''s an excellent, evocative image. Will it get the votes? Hard to say because of the iffiness of it''s fitting the challenge theme, but it certainly is deserving of recognition.</td>', 'This image seems more sad than a celebration, but it is quite excellent nonetheless. The feeling I get is that this man is a widower remembering the date with sadness rather than joy. It is a powerful image showing the other side of celebration, which can be loneliness. It''s an excellent, evocative image. Will it get the votes? Hard to say because of the iffiness of it''s fitting the challenge theme, but it certainly is deserving of recognition.', '2005-10-11 23:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777897, 241998, 38911, '<td valign="top">I like what youve done here.  The models actions are well captured.  The picture could use a little boost of colour (increase in saturation) though.  Overall good job! (o:</td>', 'I like what youve done here.  The models actions are well captured.  The picture could use a little boost of colour (increase in saturation) though.  Overall good job! (o:', '2005-10-12 00:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
