(1779251, 241796, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea for the challenge but I would have liked this a whole lot better if he was turned towards the camera instead of away and if you were closer and had lit him up with a fill flash for he is very dark compared to the sky behind him.  Like the idea though and fitting for the challenge, 5 from me.</td>', 'Not a bad idea for the challenge but I would have liked this a whole lot better if he was turned towards the camera instead of away and if you were closer and had lit him up with a fill flash for he is very dark compared to the sky behind him.  Like the idea though and fitting for the challenge, 5 from me.', '2005-10-12 11:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
