(1779268, 242148, 27482, '<td valign="top">Wow, awesome!  Must have been cool to see all these baloons going up at the same time this early.  I still am not blown away by this shot, I am very curious as to what is going on around this scene, what I mean is that I feel as I am only looking at the left part of a photo and the right half had been cut off.  Anyway, easily one of the best shos in this mediocre challenge, 8 from me.</td>', 'Wow, awesome!  Must have been cool to see all these baloons going up at the same time this early.  I still am not blown away by this shot, I am very curious as to what is going on around this scene, what I mean is that I feel as I am only looking at the left part of a photo and the right half had been cut off.  Anyway, easily one of the best shos in this mediocre challenge, 8 from me.', '2005-10-12 11:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
