(1780547, 240914, 27482, '<td valign="top">Cool, nothing we haven´t seen before but these carnivale shots always work and this is pretty well done in that regard, love the irregular spin on the lower portion and the "fighter" signs add interest.   7 from me.</td>', 'Cool, nothing we haven´t seen before but these carnivale shots always work and this is pretty well done in that regard, love the irregular spin on the lower portion and the "fighter" signs add interest.   7 from me.', '2005-10-12 18:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1780551, 240755, 27482, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot, only downside with it I want to comment on is that I don´t really care for the person being in the exact middle of the frame but everything else is top notch, love the exposure, the duotone, the texture and PP.  Highest score so far from me in the challenge, this got a 9, great work.</td>', 'Awesome shot, only downside with it I want to comment on is that I don´t really care for the person being in the exact middle of the frame but everything else is top notch, love the exposure, the duotone, the texture and PP.  Highest score so far from me in the challenge, this got a 9, great work.', '2005-10-12 18:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1780554, 242229, 27482, '<td valign="top">This would have been great but the whole shot looks "smudgy", like it´s slightly out of focus but I am sure it´s mostly from some kind of post processing.  Also, the strong halo around Leif and Hallgrimskirkja isn´t flattering so I only gave this a 5 but I like the tones in the shot, great job on the b/w conversion.</td>', 'This would have been great but the whole shot looks "smudgy", like it´s slightly out of focus but I am sure it´s mostly from some kind of post processing.  Also, the strong halo around Leif and Hallgrimskirkja isn´t flattering so I only gave this a 5 but I like the tones in the shot, great job on the b/w conversion.', '2005-10-12 18:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1780803, 241939, 11895, '<td valign="top">neat subject matter but I''m not crazy about the way it''s been edited;  the blurring of the background is too obvious; wonder what it would look like in color</td>', 'neat subject matter but I''m not crazy about the way it''s been edited;  the blurring of the background is too obvious; wonder what it would look like in color', '2005-10-12 20:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
