(1781017, 241890, 38911, '<td valign="top">This is a fresh colourful idea!  Nice work! (o:</td>', 'This is a fresh colourful idea!  Nice work! (o:', '2005-10-12 22:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1781100, 241660, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the enthusiasm of the team members and the way the coach has come down to their level. I wish the cars and fence weren''t in the background though.</td>', 'I like the enthusiasm of the team members and the way the coach has come down to their level. I wish the cars and fence weren''t in the background though.', '2005-10-12 23:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1781107, 242232, 8624, '<td valign="top">pretty girl, poor angle. the up the nostrils shot isn''t very flattering and there are annoying brigt spots on the glass.</td>', 'pretty girl, poor angle. the up the nostrils shot isn''t very flattering and there are annoying brigt spots on the glass.', '2005-10-12 23:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1781114, 241984, 42198, '<td valign="top">390 miles per hour. Impressive. Now there''s something to celebrate! Not a bad shot either. I like the frame. Composition is good.</td>', '390 miles per hour. Impressive. Now there''s something to celebrate! Not a bad shot either. I like the frame. Composition is good.', '2005-10-12 23:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1781135, 240323, 42198, '<td valign="top">Okay, your nephew is cute. But you already entered a very similar shot in the ''colours'' challenge.</td>', 'Okay, your nephew is cute. But you already entered a very similar shot in the ''colours'' challenge.', '2005-10-12 23:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1781244, 241939, 10080, '<td valign="top">I Love this shot! Best I have seen! 10</td>', 'I Love this shot! Best I have seen! 10', '2005-10-13 00:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1781354, 240189, 509, '<td valign="top">Several distracting elements in the background take away from an otherwise good action shot.  You might also try different angles for a more candid look (rather than having the subjects face directly towards the camera).</td>', 'Several distracting elements in the background take away from an otherwise good action shot.  You might also try different angles for a more candid look (rather than having the subjects face directly towards the camera).', '2005-10-13 01:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1781356, 241413, 509, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite get the title, but I''m a little dense when it comes to things like this = P<br/>Nice, creative image.</td>', 'I don''t quite get the title, but I''m a little dense when it comes to things like this = PNice, creative image.', '2005-10-13 01:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1781359, 241916, 509, '<td valign="top">From my view, it seems that the mask is the focus of the shot - it has the most contrast in the cage and top.  You might structure the composition to better emphasize this (maybe crop off a bit on the right to put it more into the upper left third of the frame).  Alternately, if you''d prefer to have focus on person (doesn''t seem to be the case here as his back is turned), a little more light to show or hint at his features should emphasize that subject.  I''m on the other side of the pond so I don''t know anything about crickett, but he seems to be enjoying it = )</td>', 'From my view, it seems that the mask is the focus of the shot - it has the most contrast in the cage and top.  You might structure the composition to better emphasize this (maybe crop off a bit on the right to put it more into the upper left third of the frame).  Alternately, if you''d prefer to have focus on person (doesn''t seem to be the case here as his back is turned), a little more light to show or hint at his features should emphasize that subject.  I''m on the other side of the pond so I don''t know anything about crickett, but he seems to be enjoying it = )', '2005-10-13 01:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1781362, 241890, 509, '<td valign="top">Great idea and subject.  Did you try any with the umbrella at the girl''s back?  I think a classic childhood smile here could really add emotion and impact to the image.  As it is now, my attention is drawn more to the daisies, but I think it would be more powerful with the girl (and her facial expression) as the focus.</td>', 'Great idea and subject.  Did you try any with the umbrella at the girl''s back?  I think a classic childhood smile here could really add emotion and impact to the image.  As it is now, my attention is drawn more to the daisies, but I think it would be more powerful with the girl (and her facial expression) as the focus.', '2005-10-13 01:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1781366, 241337, 509, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good subject, but might benefit from a more interesting/less rigid composition.  Framing the image such that the stripes create diagonals (rather than straight forward lines as they are here) in the image would strengthen it in this way imho.  Seems to be a little bit of motion blur (on the girl at the right) as well - faster shutter speed should clear that up.  Nice candid capture.</td>', 'I think this is a good subject, but might benefit from a more interesting/less rigid composition.  Framing the image such that the stripes create diagonals (rather than straight forward lines as they are here) in the image would strengthen it in this way imho.  Seems to be a little bit of motion blur (on the girl at the right) as well - faster shutter speed should clear that up.  Nice candid capture.', '2005-10-13 01:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1781367, 242057, 509, '<td valign="top">Not a bad subject, but the focus really hurts this (oversharpening unfortunately does not help much, believe me I know).  I think this subject just needs more attempts at catching the bird in focus.  Also, if you could move the branch &amp; bird further from the door, that would let the background fall into a softer focus, leaving only the bird as the focal point of the image.</td>', 'Not a bad subject, but the focus really hurts this (oversharpening unfortunately does not help much, believe me I know).  I think this subject just needs more attempts at catching the bird in focus.  Also, if you could move the branch & bird further from the door, that would let the background fall into a softer focus, leaving only the bird as the focal point of the image.', '2005-10-13 01:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1781371, 241004, 509, '<td valign="top">To me, this subject might work best for a photojournalistic approach - maybe including the fire hall or a fire truck (if possible) in the background.  The mailbox by itself doesn''t hold a lot of interest imho.  However, a more abstract approach might work as well -- perhaps a closup of the red side of the mailbox emphasizing the textures + geometry of the box.  Just my thoughts.</td>', 'To me, this subject might work best for a photojournalistic approach - maybe including the fire hall or a fire truck (if possible) in the background.  The mailbox by itself doesn''t hold a lot of interest imho.  However, a more abstract approach might work as well -- perhaps a closup of the red side of the mailbox emphasizing the textures + geometry of the box.  Just my thoughts.', '2005-10-13 01:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1781373, 242228, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice job of capturing the water, really adds a sense of motion and continuity to the image.</td>', 'Nice job of capturing the water, really adds a sense of motion and continuity to the image.', '2005-10-13 01:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1781376, 241556, 509, '<td valign="top">Great expression and angle, would be stronger imho if the left hand wasn''t cut out, though it does look ok as it''s not cropped right at the wrist.  The bright colors add impact as well.</td>', 'Great expression and angle, would be stronger imho if the left hand wasn''t cut out, though it does look ok as it''s not cropped right at the wrist.  The bright colors add impact as well.', '2005-10-13 02:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1781377, 241662, 509, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture.  The couple really stand out well against the background but still fit within the overall scene.  Strong composition and exposure as well.</td>', 'Beautiful capture.  The couple really stand out well against the background but still fit within the overall scene.  Strong composition and exposure as well.', '2005-10-13 02:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1781379, 241668, 509, '<td valign="top">Like the soft focus here and the sepia tones.  Good capture of emotion -- relates well to your title.</td>', 'Like the soft focus here and the sepia tones.  Good capture of emotion -- relates well to your title.', '2005-10-13 02:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1781386, 241750, 509, '<td valign="top">Family and good times are certainly valid reasons for celebration.  However, there are a lot of problems with this shot imho.  The background is quite busy.  I really think this should have been shot from the front of the people, adding their faces and thus providing of a personal element imho.  The lady at the side looks removed from the group -- its difficult to tell if she is meant to be in the shot or another tourist.  Don''t give up, keep trying and you will see improvement.</td>', 'Family and good times are certainly valid reasons for celebration.  However, there are a lot of problems with this shot imho.  The background is quite busy.  I really think this should have been shot from the front of the people, adding their faces and thus providing of a personal element imho.  The lady at the side looks removed from the group -- its difficult to tell if she is meant to be in the shot or another tourist.  Don''t give up, keep trying and you will see improvement.', '2005-10-13 02:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1781388, 242137, 509, '<td valign="top">Relates well to the challenge, but there seems to be significant loss of detail in the women''s faces (neatimage?)  Sharp focus of both women would strengthen this as well imho.  Otherwise, the composition and lighting are well done, with the defocused light circles in the background adding positive contributions to the shot.</td>', 'Relates well to the challenge, but there seems to be significant loss of detail in the women''s faces (neatimage?)  Sharp focus of both women would strengthen this as well imho.  Otherwise, the composition and lighting are well done, with the defocused light circles in the background adding positive contributions to the shot.', '2005-10-13 02:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1781394, 241701, 509, '<td valign="top">Without knowing the history behind this image (and there is definitely a strong connotation of one), this imparts more of a feeling of sorrow than celebration.  The debris in the foreground, the down-turned face and the wine glass all seem to point in this direction.  To the photographer I''m sure this is not the case, but to a casual observer, it''s tough to tell.  Aside from that, the image is very well done.  I like the silhouette as well as the textures and lighting in the foreground.  The light tones in the background add to the rustic look of the shot.  Great photo, but difficult to relate to the challenge imho.</td>', 'Without knowing the history behind this image (and there is definitely a strong connotation of one), this imparts more of a feeling of sorrow than celebration.  The debris in the foreground, the down-turned face and the wine glass all seem to point in this direction.  To the photographer I''m sure this is not the case, but to a casual observer, it''s tough to tell.  Aside from that, the image is very well done.  I like the silhouette as well as the textures and lighting in the foreground.  The light tones in the background add to the rustic look of the shot.  Great photo, but difficult to relate to the challenge imho.', '2005-10-13 02:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1781396, 241975, 509, '<td valign="top">A little underexposed imho.  Otherwise a good capture.  I like the soft focus effect used.</td>', 'A little underexposed imho.  Otherwise a good capture.  I like the soft focus effect used.', '2005-10-13 02:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1781397, 242143, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and execution - the sky really makes for a good background.  Only suggestion is to not crop off the cross at the top.  It restricts the steeple imho - I think it''d be more powerful with some space above allowing it to "reach" into the sky.  Exposure and focus is right on.</td>', 'Nice idea and execution - the sky really makes for a good background.  Only suggestion is to not crop off the cross at the top.  It restricts the steeple imho - I think it''d be more powerful with some space above allowing it to "reach" into the sky.  Exposure and focus is right on.', '2005-10-13 02:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1781401, 242088, 509, '<td valign="top">Great candid shot, can''t really offer any criticism other than it looks to me like the baby''s face might be a little out of focus in the full size shot.  Still, capturing the moment is often more important than the technical details, and definitely holds true here. 10</td>', 'Great candid shot, can''t really offer any criticism other than it looks to me like the baby''s face might be a little out of focus in the full size shot.  Still, capturing the moment is often more important than the technical details, and definitely holds true here. 10', '2005-10-13 02:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1781403, 241720, 509, '<td valign="top">Odd cause for celebration, but great capture of it nonetheless.  I really like the contrasts that the black and white umbrella offer with the colorful yellows and greens in the rest of the image.  Nice work.</td>', 'Odd cause for celebration, but great capture of it nonetheless.  I really like the contrasts that the black and white umbrella offer with the colorful yellows and greens in the rest of the image.  Nice work.', '2005-10-13 02:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1781449, 241943, 22970, '<td valign="top">What a wonder photograph.  The composition is absolutely perfect IMO and the photograph is balance very well. The black and white sets a mood fitting for this photograph. The expressions on the face of the grandfather is authentic and priceless. The eye contact with the child is smoothing.<br/> <br/>I have not had a photograph to hit me so sudden as this one in a long time. I hope you have it saved for framing. Your family room would not be complete without it.<br/> <br/>Congratulations 10.</td>', 'What a wonder photograph.  The composition is absolutely perfect IMO and the photograph is balance very well. The black and white sets a mood fitting for this photograph. The expressions on the face of the grandfather is authentic and priceless. The eye contact with the child is smoothing. I have not had a photograph to hit me so sudden as this one in a long time. I hope you have it saved for framing. Your family room would not be complete without it. Congratulations 10.', '2005-10-13 02:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1781681, 241796, 38234, '<td valign="top">This image certainly embodies the intent of the challenge.......what would have made it a better shot is more colour in the sky or a more dramatic sky and the loss of that horizontal line on the lower left corner as well as maybe a less centered subject:-)  Great stop action!</td>', 'This image certainly embodies the intent of the challenge.......what would have made it a better shot is more colour in the sky or a more dramatic sky and the loss of that horizontal line on the lower left corner as well as maybe a less centered subject:-)  Great stop action!', '2005-10-13 08:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
