(1783642, 242038, 42995, '<td valign="top">i suspect you chose to do this in b&amp;w to emphasize the longevity of the relationship, but b&amp;w needs a lot of texture to keep the overall image from looking flat.  the black outfits lack detail and the featureless background reinforces the flat aspect.  good luck!</td>', 'i suspect you chose to do this in b&w to emphasize the longevity of the relationship, but b&w needs a lot of texture to keep the overall image from looking flat.  the black outfits lack detail and the featureless background reinforces the flat aspect.  good luck!', '2005-10-14 09:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783650, 241780, 42995, '<td valign="top">i think this shot could have done better if we could see the ''celebration'' more clearly, rather than inferring it from the title.  since the major elements are structural, the uneven lines are a bit distracting.  a closer shot, straight-on shot might have had more impact.  good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'i think this shot could have done better if we could see the ''celebration'' more clearly, rather than inferring it from the title.  since the major elements are structural, the uneven lines are a bit distracting.  a closer shot, straight-on shot might have had more impact.  good luck in the challenge!', '2005-10-14 09:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783660, 242198, 42995, '<td valign="top">clearly you''ve added some atmosphere to this product shot, but i''m not sure if the colour, lighting and texture of the bedspread (if that''s what it is) helps...the dichotomy of the 70s style background with this 90s product is a bit unsettling, which might have been what you were attempting to achieve. good luck!</td>', 'clearly you''ve added some atmosphere to this product shot, but i''m not sure if the colour, lighting and texture of the bedspread (if that''s what it is) helps...the dichotomy of the 70s style background with this 90s product is a bit unsettling, which might have been what you were attempting to achieve. good luck!', '2005-10-14 10:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783662, 240323, 42995, '<td valign="top">a cute child with a winning smile, but the lighting/cropping of this shot doesn''t really suit me.  perhaps a closer cropped might have helped...</td>', 'a cute child with a winning smile, but the lighting/cropping of this shot doesn''t really suit me.  perhaps a closer cropped might have helped...', '2005-10-14 10:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783666, 242215, 42995, '<td valign="top">a good concept that i think suffers a bit because of the fencing in the foreground, which is not something i associate with dunk-tanks. but even with the fence in place, i think it would have been siginficantly improved by an unobstructed view of the teacher''s face.</td>', 'a good concept that i think suffers a bit because of the fencing in the foreground, which is not something i associate with dunk-tanks. but even with the fence in place, i think it would have been siginficantly improved by an unobstructed view of the teacher''s face.', '2005-10-14 10:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783669, 242099, 42995, '<td valign="top">this shot fits the challenge well but since we can''t see their faces, it might have been improved if they were standing closer, he was gripping her harder, etc.  as a technical note, this looks a bit underexposed to me, with the hand too featureless and the whites too drab.  still, a nice attempt!</td>', 'this shot fits the challenge well but since we can''t see their faces, it might have been improved if they were standing closer, he was gripping her harder, etc.  as a technical note, this looks a bit underexposed to me, with the hand too featureless and the whites too drab.  still, a nice attempt!', '2005-10-14 10:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783674, 241219, 42995, '<td valign="top">ah, the aftermath of the celebration!  the shot is a bit dark for me which makes it almost impossible to see the bottle at the left.  including other features of an apres-party mess might have improved the shot.</td>', 'ah, the aftermath of the celebration!  the shot is a bit dark for me which makes it almost impossible to see the bottle at the left.  including other features of an apres-party mess might have improved the shot.', '2005-10-14 10:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
