(1784721, 242212, 5354, '<td valign="top">Simple and reasonably effective. Doesn''t have any great WOW factor - needs to be lit better to give it some punch.</td>', 'Simple and reasonably effective. Doesn''t have any great WOW factor - needs to be lit better to give it some punch.', '2005-10-14 19:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
