(1784944, 242143, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice, spot on exposure and good colours, contrast, sharpness and the works.  However, I simply don´t understand why you cut off the top of this building?  I pretty much equivalent that with cutting off a persons head in a portrait, well maybe not that bad but still very bad.  I still gave this shot a 6 though but if there had been the top of the building in the shot and a little more space over it I would probably have given this a 7.</td>', 'Nice, spot on exposure and good colours, contrast, sharpness and the works.  However, I simply don´t understand why you cut off the top of this building?  I pretty much equivalent that with cutting off a persons head in a portrait, well maybe not that bad but still very bad.  I still gave this shot a 6 though but if there had been the top of the building in the shot and a little more space over it I would probably have given this a 7.', '2005-10-14 22:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
