(1784970, 242093, 38032, '<td valign="top">Nice "action" shot.  IMO this is a "party atmosphere" shot where his buddies would be laughing and his eyes would be shut due to fear.  It think in a case like this there should be other elements to tell the story. Also: It looks like the paper is on wire which has been cloned out !  --- clarity/contrast/color: 1/2<br/>composition,POV,DOF:1/2<br/>effort+originality: 2/2<br/>theme appropriate: 1/2<br/>aesthetic timelessness+emotion: 1/2</td>', 'Nice "action" shot.  IMO this is a "party atmosphere" shot where his buddies would be laughing and his eyes would be shut due to fear.  It think in a case like this there should be other elements to tell the story. Also: It looks like the paper is on wire which has been cloned out !  --- clarity/contrast/color: 1/2composition,POV,DOF:1/2effort+originality: 2/2theme appropriate: 1/2aesthetic timelessness+emotion: 1/2', '2005-10-14 22:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
