(1785003, 241668, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely beautiful image and it works so well in sepia. I especially love the expression of the girl on the right. Unfortunately, it''s not a sharp focus. The best thing to try for future shots is to focus as much as possible on the eyes of at least one subject. Professionals usually measure sharpness if they can see the eyelashes of a subject (of course, this is not always possible with moving subjects). For this scene, maybe shooting at f8 would have helped a bit and locking the auto focus down would have worked  abit to improve focus.</td>', 'This is an absolutely beautiful image and it works so well in sepia. I especially love the expression of the girl on the right. Unfortunately, it''s not a sharp focus. The best thing to try for future shots is to focus as much as possible on the eyes of at least one subject. Professionals usually measure sharpness if they can see the eyelashes of a subject (of course, this is not always possible with moving subjects). For this scene, maybe shooting at f8 would have helped a bit and locking the auto focus down would have worked  abit to improve focus.', '2005-10-14 22:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785008, 240630, 15207, '<td valign="top">A perfect 10! I wish you a big fat ribbon.</td>', 'A perfect 10! I wish you a big fat ribbon.', '2005-10-14 22:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785016, 242098, 37893, '<td valign="top">This is a great image. I like the focus and the long exposure. 8</td>', 'This is a great image. I like the focus and the long exposure. 8', '2005-10-14 22:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785021, 242230, 15207, '<td valign="top">I love this - it''s going to get a 9 from me. I relaly like the playfulness and the expression on the boy''s face. One little tidbit I picked up in photography school I thought I''d pass along... for portraits... always try to focus in on the eye of the subject (if you can and your subject isn''t moving too much). You should ideally try to see every detail of the eyelash. The focusing on this seems to be on the hands. It may have been what you intended, but the eye of the viewer always starts at the eyes. Anyway, thought I''d pass it along (it''s something I didn''t know till I started school).   this image is amazing. I hope you do well on this challenge.</td>', 'I love this - it''s going to get a 9 from me. I relaly like the playfulness and the expression on the boy''s face. One little tidbit I picked up in photography school I thought I''d pass along... for portraits... always try to focus in on the eye of the subject (if you can and your subject isn''t moving too much). You should ideally try to see every detail of the eyelash. The focusing on this seems to be on the hands. It may have been what you intended, but the eye of the viewer always starts at the eyes. Anyway, thought I''d pass it along (it''s something I didn''t know till I started school).   this image is amazing. I hope you do well on this challenge.', '2005-10-14 22:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785039, 242148, 509, '<td valign="top">That''s a lot of balloons.  The mist works well here, along with the sheer number of balloons.  Nice work.</td>', 'That''s a lot of balloons.  The mist works well here, along with the sheer number of balloons.  Nice work.', '2005-10-14 22:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785040, 242093, 23430, '<td valign="top">This is a classic. Great idea and well executed. Love the expression on his face.</td>', 'This is a classic. Great idea and well executed. Love the expression on his face.', '2005-10-14 22:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785043, 241939, 509, '<td valign="top">This image has a great sense of innocense associated with it, and appeals to the ideals of old fashion ''Americana''.  The depth of field looks a little unnatural to my eye but it serves to assist the overall essense.  One of my favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'This image has a great sense of innocense associated with it, and appeals to the ideals of old fashion ''Americana''.  The depth of field looks a little unnatural to my eye but it serves to assist the overall essense.  One of my favorites of the challenge.', '2005-10-14 22:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785046, 241583, 509, '<td valign="top">A little dark, but light enough to get the point across.  I might suggest dodging the main subject a bit and burning the lighter background - the background is a little distracting.  Title works great with this image.</td>', 'A little dark, but light enough to get the point across.  I might suggest dodging the main subject a bit and burning the lighter background - the background is a little distracting.  Title works great with this image.', '2005-10-14 22:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785049, 241892, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice capture with the fog and great lighting.  Might benefit from a slight clockwise rotation (the horizon may be level, but the pattern of the fog makes it look tilted a bit).</td>', 'Nice capture with the fog and great lighting.  Might benefit from a slight clockwise rotation (the horizon may be level, but the pattern of the fog makes it look tilted a bit).', '2005-10-14 22:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785058, 241178, 509, '<td valign="top">Some focus issues and a lack of a dominant subject hurt this imho.  Colors are good, but look a little oversaturated in the reds.</td>', 'Some focus issues and a lack of a dominant subject hurt this imho.  Colors are good, but look a little oversaturated in the reds.', '2005-10-14 23:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785060, 242198, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice product shot, the seductive lighting and background suit the product well and the title adds to the humor.</td>', 'Nice product shot, the seductive lighting and background suit the product well and the title adds to the humor.', '2005-10-14 23:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785062, 241742, 509, '<td valign="top">A little soft to my eye but a decent macro shot.</td>', 'A little soft to my eye but a decent macro shot.', '2005-10-14 23:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785064, 241830, 509, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, but depends a little heavily on the post-processing imho.</td>', 'Interesting image, but depends a little heavily on the post-processing imho.', '2005-10-14 23:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785067, 242068, 43463, '<td valign="top">A very sweet and endearing capture of family love and joy. That smile on the little boy''s face just captures joy and happiness all in one. <br/> <br/></td>', 'A very sweet and endearing capture of family love and joy. That smile on the little boy''s face just captures joy and happiness all in one.  ', '2005-10-14 23:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785069, 241731, 509, '<td valign="top">I think this would work better with a more dynamic background.  If there were any clouds in the sky or ground objects that could have been included, having these in the composition would add interest.  The haloing separates the jets, but the colors still blend together too much.  The yellow looks like there''s a bit too much magenta.</td>', 'I think this would work better with a more dynamic background.  If there were any clouds in the sky or ground objects that could have been included, having these in the composition would add interest.  The haloing separates the jets, but the colors still blend together too much.  The yellow looks like there''s a bit too much magenta.', '2005-10-14 23:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785070, 242194, 43463, '<td valign="top">The start of a happy life together...hmmm makes me wonder what the groom said to earn that kiss. He does look very happy.</td>', 'The start of a happy life together...hmmm makes me wonder what the groom said to earn that kiss. He does look very happy.', '2005-10-14 23:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785071, 242131, 509, '<td valign="top">Stronger focus on the person celebrating might help this imho.</td>', 'Stronger focus on the person celebrating might help this imho.', '2005-10-14 23:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785073, 241943, 509, '<td valign="top">Great shot, definitely conveys emotion.</td>', 'Great shot, definitely conveys emotion.', '2005-10-14 23:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785092, 241667, 43463, '<td valign="top">I love the subject and the focus on the single leaf caught in the rake. Lighting is especially good with very sharp focus on the main subject - the leaf caught in the rake. While this brings up strong imagery of autumn it doesn''t quite bridge the gap of connecting it to celebration. There is an element/object missing from the photo such as maybe a pile of raked leaves with the rake resting the wall next to an open window that holds a pie cooling (could be pumpkin pie or some pie which along with the pile of leaves makes us think of fall festivals or even the thanksgiving feast).....hmmm the image could even have a pile of leaves sitting there and two children caught in mid-air ready to jump into the pile of leaves to scatter them everywhere - and of course the expressions on the children''s faces would show joy. I hope you see where I am going with the suggestions and examples - there is just something missing to the photo that would make a stronger connection of conjuring up celebratory events surrounding autumn.</td>', 'I love the subject and the focus on the single leaf caught in the rake. Lighting is especially good with very sharp focus on the main subject - the leaf caught in the rake. While this brings up strong imagery of autumn it doesn''t quite bridge the gap of connecting it to celebration. There is an element/object missing from the photo such as maybe a pile of raked leaves with the rake resting the wall next to an open window that holds a pie cooling (could be pumpkin pie or some pie which along with the pile of leaves makes us think of fall festivals or even the thanksgiving feast).....hmmm the image could even have a pile of leaves sitting there and two children caught in mid-air ready to jump into the pile of leaves to scatter them everywhere - and of course the expressions on the children''s faces would show joy. I hope you see where I am going with the suggestions and examples - there is just something missing to the photo that would make a stronger connection of conjuring up celebratory events surrounding autumn.', '2005-10-14 23:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785107, 240189, 43463, '<td valign="top">While this is a really great action shot - and I love the expressions caught on the faces of the father and child - the elements in the background are detracting to the overall appeal of the image. The red truck and the hotel are elements in the background that compete with the main subject which is the two people jumping with glee into the pool. If it was at all possible I would have recommended that you shot this action against a backdrop that is almost neutral - meaning you do not have a whole lot of background elements distracting the attention away from the main focus. It may have been possible to move the angle of taking the shot to just have that backdrop of the trees that I see in the background - of course that would mean that there were hopefully no other cars parked behind that red truck.</td>', 'While this is a really great action shot - and I love the expressions caught on the faces of the father and child - the elements in the background are detracting to the overall appeal of the image. The red truck and the hotel are elements in the background that compete with the main subject which is the two people jumping with glee into the pool. If it was at all possible I would have recommended that you shot this action against a backdrop that is almost neutral - meaning you do not have a whole lot of background elements distracting the attention away from the main focus. It may have been possible to move the angle of taking the shot to just have that backdrop of the trees that I see in the background - of course that would mean that there were hopefully no other cars parked behind that red truck.', '2005-10-14 23:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785124, 241824, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, Halloween is a cause for celebration. While I like all the lawn decorations, your photo appears very grainy on my screen, and I don''t know if that was intentional or not. I wonder how this would have looked if it was truly pitch black with all the fun ornaments lit and a longer exposure?</td>', 'For me, Halloween is a cause for celebration. While I like all the lawn decorations, your photo appears very grainy on my screen, and I don''t know if that was intentional or not. I wonder how this would have looked if it was truly pitch black with all the fun ornaments lit and a longer exposure?', '2005-10-14 23:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785126, 241066, 41675, '<td valign="top">Awww, what a sweet concept for celebration (and I hope indeed she said yes). The lighting is a bit harsh to me, and makes the glasses almost seem plastic. Also, since the glasses are vertical objects I wonder how this would have looked if you shot it as a vertical (portrait) photo instead - thereby not cutting off the glasses?</td>', 'Awww, what a sweet concept for celebration (and I hope indeed she said yes). The lighting is a bit harsh to me, and makes the glasses almost seem plastic. Also, since the glasses are vertical objects I wonder how this would have looked if you shot it as a vertical (portrait) photo instead - thereby not cutting off the glasses?', '2005-10-14 23:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785128, 241800, 41675, '<td valign="top">Neat fish eye view of a fun looking pumpkin patch. Good colors. I wish the girl was smiling a bit more (to give the impression of celebration a bit more), but that pumpkin does look a bit heavy for her. :-) Hope she had fun carving it.</td>', 'Neat fish eye view of a fun looking pumpkin patch. Good colors. I wish the girl was smiling a bit more (to give the impression of celebration a bit more), but that pumpkin does look a bit heavy for her. :-) Hope she had fun carving it.', '2005-10-14 23:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785130, 242140, 41675, '<td valign="top">I agree that a new day is cause for celebration. For me though, the overcast sky and "gray mood" of the photo makes me want to crawl back into bed and pull the covers up. I do like the composition, just wish it had been a brighter day.</td>', 'I agree that a new day is cause for celebration. For me though, the overcast sky and "gray mood" of the photo makes me want to crawl back into bed and pull the covers up. I do like the composition, just wish it had been a brighter day.', '2005-10-14 23:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785133, 241004, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of celebration for the brave men and women of the fire departments. For me though, your photo doesn''t fully portray that to me. It''s a nice mailbox, but compared with other entries in the challenge seems to lack an overall..."wow" factor. I''m not good with the technical jargon, but I wonder how this would have been say if there was a uniformed arm reaching in for some mail or something? Just something else in the photo to make it more..."exciting" for the viewer?</td>', 'I like the concept of celebration for the brave men and women of the fire departments. For me though, your photo doesn''t fully portray that to me. It''s a nice mailbox, but compared with other entries in the challenge seems to lack an overall..."wow" factor. I''m not good with the technical jargon, but I wonder how this would have been say if there was a uniformed arm reaching in for some mail or something? Just something else in the photo to make it more..."exciting" for the viewer?', '2005-10-14 23:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785135, 242141, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wow - those are some really glow-like orange pumpkins!! I do agree Halloween is a cause for celebration, but unfortunately the girl doesn''t look as if she is having too much fun. Had she been carrying one of the huge ones in her arms with a big grin on her face, I would have scored this higher.</td>', 'Wow - those are some really glow-like orange pumpkins!! I do agree Halloween is a cause for celebration, but unfortunately the girl doesn''t look as if she is having too much fun. Had she been carrying one of the huge ones in her arms with a big grin on her face, I would have scored this higher.', '2005-10-14 23:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785141, 242234, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your concept, I just think with a bit better overall image quality (it looks quite grainy and oddly colored in the blues) it could score better.</td>', 'I like your concept, I just think with a bit better overall image quality (it looks quite grainy and oddly colored in the blues) it could score better.', '2005-10-14 23:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785145, 242232, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the model, but there''s something about the wine glass. Maybe it''s the way it''s tipped..looks to me as if it''s about to go right up her nose. Sorry, I''m not great with the technical jargon, but again, I like your concept of celebration.</td>', 'I like the idea and the model, but there''s something about the wine glass. Maybe it''s the way it''s tipped..looks to me as if it''s about to go right up her nose. Sorry, I''m not great with the technical jargon, but again, I like your concept of celebration.', '2005-10-14 23:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785149, 242138, 41675, '<td valign="top">A good game indeed is always worthy of celebration. For me, the lighting in your photo is a bit on the harsh or bright side. It looks like you may have lowered the saturation, but I wonder what this looked like at full color?</td>', 'A good game indeed is always worthy of celebration. For me, the lighting in your photo is a bit on the harsh or bright side. It looks like you may have lowered the saturation, but I wonder what this looked like at full color?', '2005-10-14 23:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785152, 242060, 41675, '<td valign="top">A nice family keepsake photo. For me, I wish one or two of the couples had their faces to the camera themselves. It would have added more interest for me had they been smiling at me, and I would have scored it higher then.</td>', 'A nice family keepsake photo. For me, I wish one or two of the couples had their faces to the camera themselves. It would have added more interest for me had they been smiling at me, and I would have scored it higher then.', '2005-10-14 23:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785155, 241780, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the main focus of this photo is the large banner, which unfortunately is blocked partially by the white cylindrical object in the foreground - which is distracting to me. I wonder how this would have been if you were closer to some of the people feasting? Also, be sure to try and utilize the maximum or as close to the alotted 640 pixels as stated in the challenge rules. Larger photos can sometimes have a better impact on voters :)</td>', 'For me, the main focus of this photo is the large banner, which unfortunately is blocked partially by the white cylindrical object in the foreground - which is distracting to me. I wonder how this would have been if you were closer to some of the people feasting? Also, be sure to try and utilize the maximum or as close to the alotted 640 pixels as stated in the challenge rules. Larger photos can sometimes have a better impact on voters :)', '2005-10-14 23:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785156, 241750, 41675, '<td valign="top">This is a nice family photo, but compared to other celebration entries in the challenge, it doesn''t hold my attention as well. I think perhaps because the three foreground people all have their backs to the viewer. had you taken this from the other side where I could see their expressions, I probably would have scored it higher.</td>', 'This is a nice family photo, but compared to other celebration entries in the challenge, it doesn''t hold my attention as well. I think perhaps because the three foreground people all have their backs to the viewer. had you taken this from the other side where I could see their expressions, I probably would have scored it higher.', '2005-10-15 00:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785167, 241556, 41675, '<td valign="top">She does seem as if she is celebrating. For me, I wish there was a bit more of her (not having her hand cut off) or something in the background to tell me what she is celebrating...did she win a race? I find the blue gum in her mouth a bit...distracting, but I like her rosy cheeks and smile.</td>', 'She does seem as if she is celebrating. For me, I wish there was a bit more of her (not having her hand cut off) or something in the background to tell me what she is celebrating...did she win a race? I find the blue gum in her mouth a bit...distracting, but I like her rosy cheeks and smile.', '2005-10-15 00:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785169, 241948, 41675, '<td valign="top">A nice entry and interpretation of celebration. The foreground looks a bit out of focus and blurry on my screen. I also wonder what this would have looked like if there was some hint of a blue sky in the background. Somehow showing more landscape to give an even greater sense of celebrating freedom?</td>', 'A nice entry and interpretation of celebration. The foreground looks a bit out of focus and blurry on my screen. I also wonder what this would have looked like if there was some hint of a blue sky in the background. Somehow showing more landscape to give an even greater sense of celebrating freedom?', '2005-10-15 00:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785172, 241796, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice air time...trampouline? The object in the lower left detracts a bit for me, but a fun shot. It looks vaguely familar too, like I''ve seen something similar somewhere here on DPC, just not sure where.</td>', 'Nice air time...trampouline? The object in the lower left detracts a bit for me, but a fun shot. It looks vaguely familar too, like I''ve seen something similar somewhere here on DPC, just not sure where.', '2005-10-15 00:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785174, 241920, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the little girl''s expression. Had the baby also been turned so I could see the face, and maybe a bit less on the white highlights, I would have scored it better. I like your use of black and white though.</td>', 'I like the little girl''s expression. Had the baby also been turned so I could see the face, and maybe a bit less on the white highlights, I would have scored it better. I like your use of black and white though.', '2005-10-15 00:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785248, 241890, 33982, '<td valign="top">excelent imagery</td>', 'excelent imagery', '2005-10-15 01:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785289, 241892, 42005, '<td valign="top">This is so different from anything I see....I find it delightful and surreal at the same time.  Thank you for sharing.</td>', 'This is so different from anything I see....I find it delightful and surreal at the same time.  Thank you for sharing.', '2005-10-15 01:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785293, 242228, 42005, '<td valign="top">Oh, I wish I were there.  Congratulations on a marvelous photograph.  Lovely colors, crispness,<br/>perspective.   Just wonderful. 10</td>', 'Oh, I wish I were there.  Congratulations on a marvelous photograph.  Lovely colors, crispness,perspective.   Just wonderful. 10', '2005-10-15 01:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785295, 241934, 42005, '<td valign="top">Delightful.</td>', 'Delightful.', '2005-10-15 01:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785301, 241939, 42005, '<td valign="top">I enjoy this photo~</td>', 'I enjoy this photo~', '2005-10-15 01:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785378, 241742, 45259, '<td valign="top">I really like the detail of the wings</td>', 'I really like the detail of the wings', '2005-10-15 03:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785440, 241731, 42984, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but the Blue Angels as a submision in every second challenge has worn a bit thin.  They''re right up there with the cat, the dog and the baby.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but the Blue Angels as a submision in every second challenge has worn a bit thin.  They''re right up there with the cat, the dog and the baby.', '2005-10-15 04:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785441, 242236, 42984, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, good Challenge response</td>', 'Nicely done, good Challenge response', '2005-10-15 04:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785442, 242043, 42984, '<td valign="top">Great lanscape (nice looking course too) but perhaps just a bit tenuous for the Challenge</td>', 'Great lanscape (nice looking course too) but perhaps just a bit tenuous for the Challenge', '2005-10-15 04:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785443, 241875, 42984, '<td valign="top">I''d box this in "Pride" probably closer than "Celebration" but it''s still a good strong illustrative image</td>', 'I''d box this in "Pride" probably closer than "Celebration" but it''s still a good strong illustrative image', '2005-10-15 04:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785444, 241341, 42984, '<td valign="top">Cute shot</td>', 'Cute shot', '2005-10-15 04:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785445, 241442, 42984, '<td valign="top">Great rainbow but I think it''s not going to be strong enough to score in Celebration</td>', 'Great rainbow but I think it''s not going to be strong enough to score in Celebration', '2005-10-15 04:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785447, 241799, 42984, '<td valign="top">This is a great image, love it to bits.  The trouble I have with it is in the Celebration context.  The image itself doesn''t convey the celebration.  Without its title, it has to be able to hold up the prospect</td>', 'This is a great image, love it to bits.  The trouble I have with it is in the Celebration context.  The image itself doesn''t convey the celebration.  Without its title, it has to be able to hold up the prospect', '2005-10-15 04:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785482, 241851, 42179, '<td valign="top">Great picture, it delivers ! - 9</td>', 'Great picture, it delivers ! - 9', '2005-10-15 07:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785483, 240755, 42179, '<td valign="top">Yeah !</td>', 'Yeah !', '2005-10-15 07:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785485, 241782, 42179, '<td valign="top">Cheerful &amp; lively ! - 7</td>', 'Cheerful & lively ! - 7', '2005-10-15 07:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785486, 241725, 42179, '<td valign="top">Good picture - so cute! - 7</td>', 'Good picture - so cute! - 7', '2005-10-15 07:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785487, 242068, 42179, '<td valign="top">Sweet !  Great photo - 7</td>', 'Sweet !  Great photo - 7', '2005-10-15 07:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785489, 241890, 42179, '<td valign="top">Very good.  I beleive it would have be still better if the umbrella was hold a litle higher to show more of the girl.</td>', 'Very good.  I beleive it would have be still better if the umbrella was hold a litle higher to show more of the girl.', '2005-10-15 07:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785490, 241916, 42179, '<td valign="top">Much too dark</td>', 'Much too dark', '2005-10-15 07:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785492, 241871, 42179, '<td valign="top">Photo OK but thema relation rather questionable</td>', 'Photo OK but thema relation rather questionable', '2005-10-15 07:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785495, 241679, 42179, '<td valign="top">Picture alright, but does not express celebration IMHO</td>', 'Picture alright, but does not express celebration IMHO', '2005-10-15 08:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785556, 241826, 27482, '<td valign="top">A nice candid shot, just two things I would have liked better if they were otherwise and that is that I would have preferred if one of the faces were also in the DOF and not just the hand and also if the whole head of the bride were in the frame.  Other than that though this is a nice candid shot and I think you made a good choice making this sepia and it´s very fitting for the challenge.  7 from me.</td>', 'A nice candid shot, just two things I would have liked better if they were otherwise and that is that I would have preferred if one of the faces were also in the DOF and not just the hand and also if the whole head of the bride were in the frame.  Other than that though this is a nice candid shot and I think you made a good choice making this sepia and it´s very fitting for the challenge.  7 from me.', '2005-10-15 09:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785557, 241931, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice, fireworks always look good and this is no exception.  However, what sets apart good fireworks shots from the great ones are the foreground and setting that put the great ones in another category so I "only" gave this a 6 but nothing bad about this shot at all and very fitting for the challenge.</td>', 'Nice, fireworks always look good and this is no exception.  However, what sets apart good fireworks shots from the great ones are the foreground and setting that put the great ones in another category so I "only" gave this a 6 but nothing bad about this shot at all and very fitting for the challenge.', '2005-10-15 09:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785591, 241731, 39821, '<td valign="top">The Sound of Freedom!  That''s what comes to mind when I see this photo.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-17 17:17:53.</i></td>', 'The Sound of Freedom!  That''s what comes to mind when I see this photo.', '2005-10-15 10:14:41.000000', '2005-10-17 18:17:53.000000', 1),
(1785602, 242098, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot and love the effect, great idea!  If you ever do a reshoot I would suggest having someone on this side of the train too that is standing still and looking "through" at the couple, I think that would completely nail this shot but I completely like this as it is, I gave this a 9.</td>', 'Pretty cool shot and love the effect, great idea!  If you ever do a reshoot I would suggest having someone on this side of the train too that is standing still and looking "through" at the couple, I think that would completely nail this shot but I completely like this as it is, I gave this a 9.', '2005-10-15 10:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785629, 241800, 40126, '<td valign="top">nice wide angle shot.</td>', 'nice wide angle shot.', '2005-10-15 10:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785685, 241004, 41899, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the connection between this and a celebration.</td>', 'I don''t see the connection between this and a celebration.', '2005-10-15 11:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785692, 241024, 41899, '<td valign="top">nice looking model.  a little washed out.</td>', 'nice looking model.  a little washed out.', '2005-10-15 11:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785693, 241916, 41899, '<td valign="top">I don''t get this one...?</td>', 'I don''t get this one...?', '2005-10-15 11:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785696, 241583, 41899, '<td valign="top">I like the subdued look to this...wish the model and drink were more in focus.</td>', 'I like the subdued look to this...wish the model and drink were more in focus.', '2005-10-15 11:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785702, 241750, 41899, '<td valign="top">has a snapshot feel to it and a little oof.</td>', 'has a snapshot feel to it and a little oof.', '2005-10-15 11:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
