(1786131, 241341, 509, '<td valign="top">Treatment fits well with a punk rock theme, though the focus could be a little stronger on the foreground subject.</td>', 'Treatment fits well with a punk rock theme, though the focus could be a little stronger on the foreground subject.', '2005-10-15 16:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786133, 242234, 509, '<td valign="top">Good work at freezing the motion, difficult to do given the lighting conditions.  I definitely would clone out that circle near center left</td>', 'Good work at freezing the motion, difficult to do given the lighting conditions.  I definitely would clone out that circle near center left', '2005-10-15 16:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786144, 242044, 509, '<td valign="top">Good use of the striped light (blinds?) to add interest.  The diagonals strengthen the composition.  Might suggest cropping tighter on the left and top to block out the highlight on the orange balloon but not really a problem imho.</td>', 'Good use of the striped light (blinds?) to add interest.  The diagonals strengthen the composition.  Might suggest cropping tighter on the left and top to block out the highlight on the orange balloon but not really a problem imho.', '2005-10-15 17:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786150, 242067, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice.  The soft textures and color add to the fall atmosphere here.  A shallower depth of field would work well here to de-emphasize the sharp and somewhat busy background elements.</td>', 'Nice.  The soft textures and color add to the fall atmosphere here.  A shallower depth of field would work well here to de-emphasize the sharp and somewhat busy background elements.', '2005-10-15 17:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786170, 241667, 37893, '<td valign="top">Nice colors! The soft blur/glow works well for me although some people might say it ditracts from the beauty of this image. I would lose the border too (rose border). it doesn''t really add much to the image. Just stay with the black.</td>', 'Nice colors! The soft blur/glow works well for me although some people might say it ditracts from the beauty of this image. I would lose the border too (rose border). it doesn''t really add much to the image. Just stay with the black.', '2005-10-15 17:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786172, 242138, 37893, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is a bit harsh as his hands are blown out a bit :) I do like the feeling that this image crosses over :)</td>', 'The lighting here is a bit harsh as his hands are blown out a bit :) I do like the feeling that this image crosses over :)', '2005-10-15 17:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786173, 240886, 37893, '<td valign="top">Fun image!</td>', 'Fun image!', '2005-10-15 17:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786175, 242088, 37893, '<td valign="top">Very sweet and endearing image. The hand placement is a bist distracting but I guess you can''t do anything about that. Great capture.</td>', 'Very sweet and endearing image. The hand placement is a bist distracting but I guess you can''t do anything about that. Great capture.', '2005-10-15 17:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786177, 240630, 37893, '<td valign="top">Not really sure what I''m seeing here. As far as the colors go, it''s great and so is the offset comp of this image.</td>', 'Not really sure what I''m seeing here. As far as the colors go, it''s great and so is the offset comp of this image.', '2005-10-15 17:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786178, 242229, 37893, '<td valign="top">Very nice tonal values this image has :) I like the different shades that the overall image produces. :)</td>', 'Very nice tonal values this image has :) I like the different shades that the overall image produces. :)', '2005-10-15 17:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786179, 241634, 37893, '<td valign="top">How you maaged to capture this image during a performance astounds me. Colors are great but the slight tilt to the right is especially enhanced by the red vs. black contrast.</td>', 'How you maaged to capture this image during a performance astounds me. Colors are great but the slight tilt to the right is especially enhanced by the red vs. black contrast.', '2005-10-15 17:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786181, 241337, 37893, '<td valign="top">Indeed something to celebrate but I wish there was more image to this :9</td>', 'Indeed something to celebrate but I wish there was more image to this :9', '2005-10-15 17:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786184, 241875, 37893, '<td valign="top">The flagpole being cutoff at the top is slightly distracting. I would push the green colors more in this image to make things pop!</td>', 'The flagpole being cutoff at the top is slightly distracting. I would push the green colors more in this image to make things pop!', '2005-10-15 17:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786185, 242220, 37893, '<td valign="top">Ethnic diversity is definitely something to celebrate about. This image however tends to make me look to the right because of the positions of theirs eyes. The color and sharpness is ideal for this indoor shoot.</td>', 'Ethnic diversity is definitely something to celebrate about. This image however tends to make me look to the right because of the positions of theirs eyes. The color and sharpness is ideal for this indoor shoot.', '2005-10-15 17:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786186, 241923, 37893, '<td valign="top">the slight crop of the corner is a bit distracting. However, the golden tint that this image has is quite pleasing and seems to fit the title and story of your image :) Great!</td>', 'the slight crop of the corner is a bit distracting. However, the golden tint that this image has is quite pleasing and seems to fit the title and story of your image :) Great!', '2005-10-15 17:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
