(1786198, 241747, 19708, '<td valign="top">I like the low angle of this shot.<br/>Background subjects supportive, but not central focal point.<br/>(assume clams are in the bucket?)</td>', 'I like the low angle of this shot.Background subjects supportive, but not central focal point.(assume clams are in the bucket?)', '2005-10-15 18:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
