(1786203, 241939, 19708, '<td valign="top">I like the look and feel here, escpecially in B&amp;W.<br/>Everything says time capsule - old cars, old bikes, etc.<br/>One minor ding that I noticed, is the use of selective blur in the background. Needs to be gradual, getting more out of focus appearing as it goes further away, and section between the girls was missed, and the girl standing up has blurry hair at the top - oops! (6)<br/><i>(Edited to correct the spelling )</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-17 01:21:22.</i></td>', 'I like the look and feel here, escpecially in B&W.Everything says time capsule - old cars, old bikes, etc.One minor ding that I noticed, is the use of selective blur in the background. Needs to be gradual, getting more out of focus appearing as it goes further away, and section between the girls was missed, and the girl standing up has blurry hair at the top - oops! (6)(Edited to correct the spelling )', '2005-10-15 18:08:26.000000', '2005-10-17 02:21:22.000000', 1),
(1786205, 241583, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice tone and feel here.<br/>Exposure looks just right, as do the color levels and dof.<br/>Nicely done (7)</td>', 'Nice tone and feel here.Exposure looks just right, as do the color levels and dof.Nicely done (7)', '2005-10-15 18:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786206, 242233, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice picture and composition.<br/>Can''t  this really says celebration without the title being only connection. (5)</td>', 'Nice picture and composition.Can''t  this really says celebration without the title being only connection. (5)', '2005-10-15 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1786209, 241731, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.<br/>Kinda'' feels like a bit of a stretch to say this is celebration.<br/>Looks like perhaps a bit aggressive on shadow/highlights as the halo effect around the jets gives this an odd feel to it. (5)</td>', 'Nice composition.Kinda'' feels like a bit of a stretch to say this is celebration.Looks like perhaps a bit aggressive on shadow/highlights as the halo effect around the jets gives this an odd feel to it. (5)', '2005-10-15 18:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
