(1786213, 241851, 19708, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, as it is simplistic and emotive - something I think we all can relate to.<br/>Not sure the tone works for me that  much. Perhaps just B&amp;W would change the feel considerably. (6)</td>', 'I like this shot, as it is simplistic and emotive - something I think we all can relate to.Not sure the tone works for me that  much. Perhaps just B&W would change the feel considerably. (6)', '2005-10-15 18:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
