(1787632, 241468, 41675, '<td valign="top">While your photo does convey celebration, I wish the couple was a bit more in focus as it seems a bit blurred around his head. Also, I find the person with the camera in the back right hand side somewhat distracting. I do like the light streaks from the bubble though - looks like it was a fun time.</td>', 'While your photo does convey celebration, I wish the couple was a bit more in focus as it seems a bit blurred around his head. Also, I find the person with the camera in the back right hand side somewhat distracting. I do like the light streaks from the bubble though - looks like it was a fun time.', '2005-10-16 14:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1787633, 242096, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the colors. I wonder how this would have looked if taken from the other side so I could have seen their faces. It would have added more interest for me.</td>', 'I like the colors. I wonder how this would have looked if taken from the other side so I could have seen their faces. It would have added more interest for me.', '2005-10-16 14:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1787635, 241742, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice butterfly macro. Good colors and texture. Bumping up after second look.</td>', 'Nice butterfly macro. Good colors and texture. Bumping up after second look.', '2005-10-16 14:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1787636, 241998, 8624, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this image as I think there is something intriguing here. I am amused by the people, clearly expressing the exhurberance, but I find it particularly funny because they look like goths or part of the hip crowd all decked out in black and to see them showing such unabashed emotion seems out of character, but refreshing. It is also interesting to see them facing away from the camera. I wish the girl on the right had all her hair in frame, but overall a good effort nd one of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this image as I think there is something intriguing here. I am amused by the people, clearly expressing the exhurberance, but I find it particularly funny because they look like goths or part of the hip crowd all decked out in black and to see them showing such unabashed emotion seems out of character, but refreshing. It is also interesting to see them facing away from the camera. I wish the girl on the right had all her hair in frame, but overall a good effort nd one of my favorites in this challenge.', '2005-10-16 14:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1787637, 242231, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the fun you captured on the two women, and your use of black and white. Too bad about the people in the background though. The blurred woman off to the right detracts my eyes from the ladies in the foreground.</td>', 'I like the fun you captured on the two women, and your use of black and white. Too bad about the people in the background though. The blurred woman off to the right detracts my eyes from the ladies in the foreground.', '2005-10-16 14:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
