(1787793, 239674, 44860, '<td valign="top">I like non set-up shots to cacth a moment. A bit of sharpness and recomposing for feet not to touch lower border would make it better.</td>', 'I like non set-up shots to cacth a moment. A bit of sharpness and recomposing for feet not to touch lower border would make it better.', '2005-10-16 16:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
