(1788744, 242230, 42198, '<td valign="top">Bumping this up. I keep coming back to it, trying to figure out what''s wrong! - The lighting and composition are fine. Focus isn''t great on the girl, but that''s a minor point. I think what it is is that the boy looks like he doesn''t want to be there.</td>', 'Bumping this up. I keep coming back to it, trying to figure out what''s wrong! - The lighting and composition are fine. Focus isn''t great on the girl, but that''s a minor point. I think what it is is that the boy looks like he doesn''t want to be there.', '2005-10-16 23:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
