(1789451, 240755, 35517, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Sinky:</b></div><hr/><i> Thats incredible. Such drama and mood. I''m sure that''s Merewether tidal pool. I often tried to photograph it, when I lived there, - but never ever captured it like you have. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>hey thanks.. your very close... it''s Bogey Hole, just north of merewether baths.. when did you live there.??<br/>and thanks so much for the encouraging words.. i was very lucky this day, i was suppose to be there at sunup, but we slept in, and didn''t end up getting there til midday, i was bummed as it was a really hot glary day, then these guy''s showed up , and gave me some fun to  photograph... i have some really good ones of him getting washed back in the pool.....</td>', 'Originally posted by Sinky: Thats incredible. Such drama and mood. I''m sure that''s Merewether tidal pool. I often tried to photograph it, when I lived there, - but never ever captured it like you have.   hey thanks.. your very close... it''s Bogey Hole, just north of merewether baths.. when did you live there.??and thanks so much for the encouraging words.. i was very lucky this day, i was suppose to be there at sunup, but we slept in, and didn''t end up getting there til midday, i was bummed as it was a really hot glary day, then these guy''s showed up , and gave me some fun to  photograph... i have some really good ones of him getting washed back in the pool.....', '2005-10-17 05:19:24.000000', NULL, 0),
