(1790347, 241943, 31133, '<td valign="top">This image makes me smile and look forward to being a grandmother one day (yikes, did I really say that?). It is one of the most loving shots I''ve seen in a long time. Really like the b&amp;w, as well as where each of your eyes are looking: You gazing at her little, sweet face while she''s gazing into the camera. Great job!</td>', 'This image makes me smile and look forward to being a grandmother one day (yikes, did I really say that?). It is one of the most loving shots I''ve seen in a long time. Really like the b&w, as well as where each of your eyes are looking: You gazing at her little, sweet face while she''s gazing into the camera. Great job!', '2005-10-17 15:33:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1790362, 242148, 15922, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! It''s great to see a ribbon being won by someone who''s not won any before... it gives the rest of us some hope :-)<br/> <br/>I didn''t vote in this challenge, but would have given your shot an 8/9 probably. Well done.</td>', 'Congratulations! It''s great to see a ribbon being won by someone who''s not won any before... it gives the rest of us some hope :-) I didn''t vote in this challenge, but would have given your shot an 8/9 probably. Well done.', '2005-10-17 15:44:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(1790417, 241890, 39664, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by madison461:</b></div><hr/><i> Very sweet!  One of my favorites! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Congratulations on winning the blue!  Very deserving!  I finally picked a winner!  :-)</td>', 'Originally posted by madison461: Very sweet!  One of my favorites!   Congratulations on winning the blue!  Very deserving!  I finally picked a winner!  :-)', '2005-10-17 16:19:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1790419, 240755, 39664, '<td valign="top">Congrats!  Awesome photo!</td>', 'Congrats!  Awesome photo!', '2005-10-17 16:22:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1790442, 242098, 19961, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the top 10!  I honestly don''t know what the people voteing 1,2 or 3 for this image was thinking about ;)  It deserved to win in my opinion.  Well done!<br/> <br/>If others want to know how, here is my guess:<br/> <br/>The picture is the Oslo underground (T-banen) probably taken on a tripod with a long shutter time.  What you see in the background is an advertisement for the train to the airport (two people kissing, with the<br/>text "sometimes it is nice to be able to take the next train"). So Terje probably pressed the trigger just before the underground train arrives, thus getting a clearly defined advertisement, a blurry train and a great picture!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-17 15:47:57.</i></td>', 'Congrats on the top 10!  I honestly don''t know what the people voteing 1,2 or 3 for this image was thinking about ;)  It deserved to win in my opinion.  Well done! If others want to know how, here is my guess: The picture is the Oslo underground (T-banen) probably taken on a tripod with a long shutter time.  What you see in the background is an advertisement for the train to the airport (two people kissing, with thetext "sometimes it is nice to be able to take the next train"). So Terje probably pressed the trigger just before the underground train arrives, thus getting a clearly defined advertisement, a blurry train and a great picture!', '2005-10-17 16:47:28.000000', '2005-10-17 16:47:57.000000', 0),
(1790482, 241667, 23680, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot Judy - congrats!</td>', 'Gorgeous shot Judy - congrats!', '2005-10-17 17:10:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1790487, 241413, 25397, '<td valign="top">Wow, I can''t believe how many people didn''t get this. I love everything you did with it and it truly is an inspiring peice of art</td>', 'Wow, I can''t believe how many people didn''t get this. I love everything you did with it and it truly is an inspiring peice of art', '2005-10-17 17:12:39.000000', NULL, 0),
