(1790905, 241293, 41066, '<td valign="top">I came across your profile and I have to say I was really impressed.  Shots like this tell me that you have a wonderful future ahead of you.  I was blown away when I saw how old you were and the quality of your photographs.  I really look forward to seeing some more great photos from you.</td>', 'I came across your profile and I have to say I was really impressed.  Shots like this tell me that you have a wonderful future ahead of you.  I was blown away when I saw how old you were and the quality of your photographs.  I really look forward to seeing some more great photos from you.', '2005-10-17 20:36:54.000000', NULL, 0),
