(1791255, 241990, 11769, '<td valign="top">I like this one. Funny I get the opposite feeling from the rest of the commenter''s. All these people driving on one side of the road are actually the happy ones. They are on the ''Good side of the road.''<br/>The side thats empty is the bad side, thats why none wants to drive on it. john</td>', 'I like this one. Funny I get the opposite feeling from the rest of the commenter''s. All these people driving on one side of the road are actually the happy ones. They are on the ''Good side of the road.''The side thats empty is the bad side, thats why none wants to drive on it. john', '2005-10-17 23:07:18.000000', NULL, 0),
